<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- AUSHI BIBLE TRANSLATION</book>
  <para style="h">MATEYO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Imbila Yabune iyalembele Mateyo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mateyo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="mt2">IMBILA YABUNE IYALEMBELE</para>
  <para style="mt1">MATEYO</para>
  <para style="imt">UBULONDOLOSHI</para>
  <para style="ip">Iki e kitabo kimo pa fitabo fine ifyo bakuuta ati, “Imbila Yabune.” Kila kitabo kyalilondolola pa bumi bwakwa Klistu. Fyalilembelwe na Mateyo, Mako, Luka na Yowane.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bakasambilila ba kyebo tabaishibapo ulo ikitabo kyakwa Mateyo kyalembelwe, nomba batunganya fye ati kwena limbi ni mu mwaka wa 60 AD. Kabili inkende uko kyalembelwe nako takwaishibikwapo nomba nakyo kitunganishiwa fye ati, ni mu Palestine nangula mu Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kalemba ali ni Mateyo uwali ni kasonkesha wa musonko libe Yesu talati kumukuuta ukwisa kuba umusambi wakwe. Ishina lyakwe limbi ainikilwe ati Lebi. Ali umo pa basambi ikumi limo na babili, elo kabili alembeele Abayuda no kulanda sana pa malembo ya Mukipingano kya Kale ukukisha na pa makumi mutanda (60). Alimbikile pa kulangilila ati Yesu e Klistu kapususha uwasalilwe na Lesa uo bakasesema basobelepo. Kabili Mateyo alilembelepo sana pa Bufumu bwa mwiulu. Abayuda bali kusubila ati Yesu akesa kuteeka nge mfumu ya pa kyalo. Ekyo Mateyo alibikisheko sana mano no ku bakinkisha pa kulondolola Ubufumu bwakwa Lesa ubwa ku Mupashi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ikitabo kyakwa Mateyo kyabune sana pantu ukutampila fye kwa Kipingano Kipya mwalilembwamo amalembo ayengi ayo bafumya mu Kipingano kya kale. Ekyo Ikitabo kyakwa Mateyo kyalilundinkanya ifipingano fyonse fibili, ikya kale ne kipya. Bakasambilila ba kyebo baleeba ati limbi Mateyo ali kupalakanya ifitabo ifyakuba e fitabo fasano ifyakwa Mose mu Kipingano kya Kale: Imbila yakwa Yesu pa lupili (Mateyo kyapita 5 ukufika na mu kyapita 7) kuti twaipalakanya kuli lulya Lesa apeele Mose amafunde (Amafunde 19.3–23.33).</para>
  <para style="iot">Ubutantiko bwa milandu</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Mateyo atampilapo kulanda pa kufyalwa kwakwa Yesu ne ntampilo ya bupyungishi bwakwe.</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Akonkeshapo no kulondolola pa masambilisho ayengi (ukutampila mu kyapita 5 ukufika na mu kyapita 25).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Pa kupelekeshako, alanda pa milimo yakwa Yesu mu kufwa no kushikuka kwakwe (ukutampila mu kyapita 26 ukufika na mu kyapita 28).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s">Ifikolwe fyakwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luka3.23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Ifi efikolwe fyakwa Yesu Klistu mwana Davidi, mwana Ablahamu. <verse eid="MAT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Ablahamu afyele Isaki, Isaki naye afyele Yakobo, Yakobo afyele Yuda na bawabo, <verse eid="MAT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />Yuda afyele Pelesi na Sela muli Tama. Peleshi afyele Heshiloni, Heshiloni afyele, Lamu, <verse eid="MAT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Lamu wishi lyakwa Aminadabu uwafyele Nashoni, Nashoni naye afyele Samoni, <verse eid="MAT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />Samoni afyele Boasi elo Boasi afyele Obedi uo nyina ali ni Lute, Obedi e wafyele Yese, <verse eid="MAT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />kabili Yese e wishi lya mfumu Davidi. Davidi naye epakufyalamo Solomoni muli muka Uliya. <verse eid="MAT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Solomoni e wishi lyakwa Lehoboamu, na Lehoboamu afyele Abiya uwali wishi lyakwa Asa. <verse eid="MAT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Asa afyele Yehoshafati wishi lyakwa Yeholamu, Yeholamu afyele Usiya. <verse eid="MAT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Usiya naye afyele Yotamu naye kwisa kufyala Ahasi, Ahasi afyele Hesekia <verse eid="MAT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />wishi lyakwa Manase. Manase afyele Amosi. Amosi naye afyele Yosiya. <verse eid="MAT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />Elo Yosiya naye epakuba wishi lyakwa Yekoniya na bawabo panuma ya kusendwa bunkole ku Babiloni. <verse eid="MAT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Yekoniya naye afyele Shealiteli panuma ya ku sendwa bunkole ku Babiloni. Shealiteli afyele Selubabele. <verse eid="MAT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Selubabele afyele Abihudi, Abihudi afyele Elyakimu elo Elyakimu naye epakufyala Asoli. <verse eid="MAT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Asoli afyele Sadoki. Sadoki afyele Akimu elo Akimu naye epakufyala Elyudi. <verse eid="MAT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Elyudi afyele Elyesa, Elyesa e wishi lyakwa Matani. Matani afyele Yakobo, <verse eid="MAT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />Yakobo naye ewafyele Yosefu muka Maliya nyina lyakwa Yesu uyo bakuuta ati, Klistu. <verse eid="MAT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Ekyo inkulo shonse ukutampila fye pali Ablahamu ukushinta pali Davidi shaba ikumi limo na shine. Kabili ukufuma kuli Davidi ukushinta fye na ku kusendwa bunkole ku Babiloni napo pali nkulo ikumi limo na shine. Kabili ukutampila panshita ya muli bunkole ukushinta pali Klistu napo pali pitilepo inkulo ikumi limo na shine.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukufyalwa kwakwa Yesu Klistu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luka2.1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Ifi efyali ukufyalwa kwakwa Yesu Klistu. Maliya uwaishile kufyala Yesu alisongelwe kuli Yosefu. Nomba ulo tabalati kubapamo, kyalisangilwe ati Maliya alimitile ukupitila mu maka ya Mupashi wa Mushilo. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Nomba ikyo Yosefu ali mololoke, tafwaile kusebanya Maliya. Alipingile fye ukumulekela mu nkaama. <verse eid="MAT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Ulo akili akotontonkanyapo, Malaika wakwa Shikulu alimubonekele kutulo mu kiloto no kumweba ati, “Yosefu mwana Davidi, wiba na mwenso pakusenda Maliya pakwebati abe mukashi obe, pantu ikyo emitile kyakufuma kuli Mupashi wa Mushilo. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />Akesa kufyala umwalalume na webo ukamwinikile ati, Yesu, ikyo eukesa kupususha abantu bakwe ku membu shabo.” <verse eid="MAT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Ifi fyonse fyakitikile pa kufikilisha ikyo Shikulu asobele muli kasesema ati, <verse eid="MAT 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />“Nakisungu akesa kwimita no kufyala umwalalume akenikwa ati, Imanueli,” ili shina lyapilibwila mu kwebati, “Lesa aliba pamo na fwebo.” <verse eid="MAT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Yosefu pa kwalamuka mutulo, epakukonka fyeke fyo aebelwe kuli Malaika, no kusenda umukashi wakwe Maliya ku nganda kwakwe. <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />Nomba tapangilepo nakwe kyupo mpaka Maliya aisa kupaapa umwana umwalalume, na Yosefu alimwinikile ne shina ati ni Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s">Abamano bafuma ku kabanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Panuma ya kufyalwa kwakwa Yesu, mu mushi wa Betelemu, ulo imfumu Helodi yali kuteeka umusumba wa Yudea, abamano balifumine ku kabanga baishile ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />Elo baisa kwipusha ati, “Alipi uyo afyelwe, Imfumu ya Bayuda? Twalibwene ulutanda lwakwe lulisumbukile, efyo twaishila ati tumushinshimune.” <verse eid="MAT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Imfumu Helodi pa kumfye fyo yalisakamikilwe sana pamo fye na bekashi ba mu musumba wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Yalitile banshimapepo bakindami na bakafundisha ba mafunde, no kubepukisha uko Klistu ali no kufyalilwa. <verse eid="MAT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />Balimwasukile ati, “Ni mu mushi wa Betelemu mu kyalo kya Yudea pantu efyalembele kasesema,<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />‘Webo Betelemu wa mu kyalo kya Yuda, wi ibonati uliwakepeshapo pa misumba ya Yuda, pantu ni muli webo wine emukafuma kateeka, umukemi wa Islaeli, abantu bangi.’”<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Elo Helodi akuutile abamano mu nkaama no kwisa kumfwako palwa kashita apo ulutanda lwabonekele, <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />epakubatuma ku Betelemu no kubeba ati, “Kabuyeni mufwailishe apo afyalilwe, elo nga mwamusanga kwisa kungebako pakwebati nandibo nkese kumushinshimuna.”<verse eid="MAT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Panuma yakumfwa kufyo imfumu yabebele, baile fye mpaka bafika apaali Umwana, epo ulutanda lwaile kwimakana. <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />Balisansamukile pakubona ulutanda. <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Ulo baingile mung'anda, balibwene umwana na Maliya, nyina elo bafukeme no kumushinshimuna, no kwisula ifipao fyabo no kumupeela ifyabupe fya golide, ulubani, na Muri.<verse eid="MAT 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Kabili ulo bakengeshiwe mu kiloto ati bekabwekela kuli Helodi, nabo pa ku bwekelamo kwabo, ba bomfeshe nshila imbi.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bafyukila ku Egupto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Ulo bafumine palya, malaika wakwa Shikulu alibonekele kuli Yosefu mu kiloto no kumweba ati, “Alamuka, fyukileni mwense ku Egupto, webo, Umwana na nyina no kuya kwikala kulya kwine mpaka nkakwebe. Pantu Helodi ali na mapinge ya kwipayo mwana.”<verse eid="MAT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Epakwalamuka, ubushiku bweka no kufyusha umwana na nyina no kuya ku Egupto. <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />Epakwikala kulya kwine mpaka ulo Helodi afwile, pa kufikilisha ikyalandilwe na Shikulu ukupitila muli bakasesema ati, “Nakuutile Umwana wangi ukufuma mu Egupto.”<verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Helodi aipaya abana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Imfumu Helodi pa kwiluka ati, abamano balimubepele, alifulilwe no kweba abakwipaya abana abalalume bonse mu Betelemu abali ne myaka ibili ukwisa panshi, ukukonka ne nshita aebelwepo kubamano.<verse eid="MAT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Epakufikilisha ikyalandilwe na kasesema Yelemiya ati,<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />“Ishiwi likoumfwikila mu Rama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">ilya kulila no kuloosha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">Rakeli akolila bana bakwe no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">kukaana ukutalalikwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">pantu balilobele.”<verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bafuma ku Egupto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Panuma yakufwa kwakwa Helodi, malaika wakwa Shikulu alibonekele kuli Yosefu ku Egupto mu kiloto, <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />no kumweba ati, “Ima bwekesha Umwana pamo na nyina ku Islaeli pantu abakwete amapinge ya kumwipaya balifwile.” <verse eid="MAT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Epakubwekesha Umwana na nyina ku Islaeli.<verse eid="MAT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Pakumfwa ati nomba ni Akelausi eukoteeka Yudea ewapyene wishi Helodi, aumfwo mwenso wa kuyako. Elo kabili asokelwe mu kilooto, epakuya ku kyalo kya Galile.<verse eid="MAT 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />Aile kwikala mu musumba wa Nasaleti pakufikilisha ikyalandilwe na bakasesema ati, “Bakale kumukuuta umwina Nasalene.”<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s">Yowane kabatisha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mako1.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka3.1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yowane1.19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Muli sho nshiku Yowane kabatisha alishile mu kiswebebe kya mu Yudea akobila ati, <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />“Lapileni pantu Bufumu bwa mwiulu bulipalamine” <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Ni ulya wine kasesema Isaya alandilepo ati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">“Ishiwi likobilikisha mu kiswebebe likoeba ati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">‘Pekanyeni umwakupita Shikulu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">olololeni nshila shakwe!’ ”<verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />Yowane ali kufwala umwingila wapangilwe na masako ya ngamali no mushipi wa mpapa mu musana. Makanta no buki efyo ali kulya. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Abekashi ba mu Yelusalemu na mu Yudea monse na kumukulo wa nika ya Yodani baile kuli ena. <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />Bali kuisosela imembu shabo no kule kubatishiwa mu nika ya Yodani.<verse eid="MAT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Pakubona Abafalise na Basaduke abengi bakoisa uko ali kubatisha, alibebele ati, “Mwe bufyashi bwa mafolo mwebo, ni nani amikengesha ukufulumuka ku bukali bukoisa? <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Kiteni fyakulangilila ati mulilapile. <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />Mwi ebati muli ba mwana Ablahamu, pantu muli aya mabwe Lesa kuti aimyamo ba mwana Ablahamu. <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />Isembe libikilwe peshinte lya fimuti, ikimuti kyonse ikitatwala fisabo ku kitema no kukipoosa mu mulilo. <verse eid="MAT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />Nkomibatisha ku menshi ku kulapila nomba uyo uwa kunkonkapo uwakukila pali nebo, uo ne nkwabilo shakwe teti mfumye ku makasa yakwe. Akesa kumibatisha kuli Mupashi wa Mushilo na ku mulilo. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />Mu minwe yakwe mulipo ulupe lwa kwelelako, akafumya imisungu palubansa no kwisa kututila ing'ano mu butala bwakwe, imisungu yena bakesa kuyokya mu mulilo uutashimapo.”<verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulubatisho lwakwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mako1.9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luka3.21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Elo Yesu pa kufika kunika ya Yodani ukufuma ku kyalo kya Galile ukwisa kubatishiwa kuli Yowane mu nika ya Yodani. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Yowane atala akaana ati, “Newa ku batishiwa kuli webo ni nebo, nomba apa waisa kuli nebo?”<verse eid="MAT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Yesu alimwasukile ati, “Nakibe fyo pali nomba pantu efyo kilingile pa kufishapo ubololoke bonse.” Yowane naye epakusumina. <verse eid="MAT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Panuma yakubatishiwa ulo afuma mu menshi, pekapo iulu lyali keneme, epakubona Mupashi wakwa Lesa akoituluka mu musango wa nkunda no kwisa kwikala pali Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Kwali fumine ne shiwi kwiulu ati, “Uyu e Mwana wangi natemwisha eo mbekelwamo.”<verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s">Yesu atunkwa kuli Kiwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mako1.12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luka4.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />Elo Mupashi atungulwile Yesu mu kiswebebe uko ali kutunkwa kuli Kiwa. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Panuma ya kufunga ikyakulya pa nshiku amakumi yane, alyumfwile nsala. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Elo Kiwa alishile kutunka Yesu ati, “Webo nga uli Mwana Lesa eba aya mabwe yalukile mu mukate.” <verse eid="MAT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />Yesu alimwasukile ati, “Ikyalembwa kitiila, ‘tekumukate weka umuntu angabelapo uwamweo kano ku kyebo kyonse ikyakufuma ku kanwa kakwa Lesa.’ ” <verse eid="MAT 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Kabili Kiwa alitwele Yesu ku musumba wa mushilo epakumuninika pa nsonshi ye Tempele. <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />No kumweba ati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">“Nga ni webo Mwana Lesa, uitunsule panshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">apo kyalilembwa ati, ‘akeba bamalaika bakwe ukusunga webo mu maboko yabo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">pakwebati taungaipuntula nangula lukasa kwibwe.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />Yesu alimwasukile ati, “Wile kwesha Shikulu Lesa obe.”<verse eid="MAT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Kabili Kiwa alitwele Yesu pa lupili lwa kulepa sana no kule kumulangisha amabufumu yonse aya pesonde no bukindami bwa yako bonse. <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />Alimwebele Yesu ati, “Fyonse ifi nkakupeela nga wafukama no kunshinshimuna.”<verse eid="MAT 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />Yesu naye alimwebele ati, “Fuma pano Satana! Apo kyalilembwa ati, ‘Ni Lesa eka ungashinshimuna, kabili enafye eka ewakule kumupyungila.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Elo Kiwa alifuminepo, na bamalaika balisa kwafwilisha Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abasambi bapa kutampa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mako1.14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luka4.14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />Pakumfwa ati Yowane balimupoosele mu kifungo, Yesu alile ku Galile. <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />Ulo afumine mu Nasaleti ailekwikala ku Kapenamu ku mukulo wa bemba wa Galile mu kyalo mwa Sebuluni na Nafutali. <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />Kyali nipa kufikilisha ikyalembelwe na kasesema Isaya ati,<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />“We mpanga yakwa Sebuluni, impanga yakwa Nafutali, umusebo wa kulungama kuli bemba, impanga bushilya bwa nika ya Yodani na ku Benafyalo ku Galile, <verse eid="MAT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />Abekala mu mfinshi balibwene ulubuuto ulukulu, na ku baikala mu mpanga ya kinshingwa kya mfwa nako bulikile.”<verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Ukufumapo Yesu alitampile ukubila ati, “Lapileni pantu Ubufumu bwa mwiulu bulipalamine.”<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuuta abashila be sabi bane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mako1.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luka5.1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Yesu alikwenda ku mukulo wa bemba wa Galile elo alibwene abana nkashi babili, Simoni uwalikwitwa Petelo na Andeleya, bakoteya makonde, pantu bali bashila besabi. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Yesu epakubakuuta ati, “Nkonkeni, nkomipanga abashila ba bantu.” <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />Pekapo balishile amakonde yabo no kumukonka. <verse eid="MAT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Ukwendelelako pantanshi panini epakusangapo kabili abana nkashi na bambi babili bamwana Sebede bali mu bwange pamo na wishibo, bakopekanya amakonde yabo. Epakubakuuta na bena. <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />Pekapo, balifumine mu bwange ukusha wishibo no kukonka Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu afundisha, ashimikila no kuposha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luka6.17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />Yesu alikwendauka mu Galile monse, ukufundisha mu ma Sinagoge akobila Imbila Yabune iya Bufumu no kule kuposha malwele no kukonswa konse mu bantu. <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />Ululumbi lwakwe lwali sabankaniwe mu Silia monse, elo bamuleteele abali kulwala amalwele ya ku pusana pusana, abali ne fibanda na ba kipumputu, aba bulebe, naye Yesu ali baposeshe bonse. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Abantu abakuti ubwingi balimukonkele ukufuma ku Galile na Dekapoli, ukufuma ku Yelusalemu na Yudea no kufuma bushilya bwa nika ya Yodani.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s">Imbila pa lupili 5.1—7.29</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Ulo Yesu abwene ibumbe likulu, aile kwikala pambali ya lupili na basambi bakwe balimushingulukile, <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />elo atampile ukule kubafundisha ati,<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ishuko line nene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Luka6.20-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />“Bakushuka abalanda mu mitima pantu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:3">ebene ba Bufumu bwa mwiulu. <verse eid="MAT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />Bakushuka abaloosha pantu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:4">bakesa kutalalikwa.<verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />“Bakushuka abakuikefya pantu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:5">bakapyana isonde. <verse eid="MAT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />Bakushuka abomfwe nsala ne kilaka kya bololoke pantu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:6">bakesa kwikuta.<verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />“Bakushuka aba luse pantu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:7">nabo bakesa kulangwa uluse.<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />“Bakushuka abasanguluke mitima pantu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:8">bakabona Lesa. <verse eid="MAT 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />Bakushuka abakita umutende pantu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:9">bakakuutwa abana bakwa Lesa. <verse eid="MAT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />Bakushuka abo bonse abapakaswa pa mulandu wa bololoke pantu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:10">ebene ba Bufumu bwa mwiulu.”<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />“Muli shukile ulo bamituka, ukumipakasa no kule kumibepesha ifyabufi pa mulandu we shina lyangi. <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />Sekeleleni no kwanga pantu ikilambu kyenu mwiulu kilikulile, efyo bapakese na bakasesema abaliko kale.”<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umukele no lubuuto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mako9.50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luka14.34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />“Muli mukele wa pano Isonde. Nomba umukele nga wasunduka, wingaloweshiwa ne ndo kabili? Wa kupoosa fye no ku nyantaulwapo apo tauli kintu.<verse eid="MAT 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />“Muli lubuuto lwa pano isonde. Umusumba uwakulwa pa lupili taungafisama. <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />Ekyo tapalipo ungasanika akatolitoli elo aputikapo inongo. Babika apakusansunka epakwebati ing'anda yonse ibuute. <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />Mu musango umo wine lekeni ulubuuto lwenu lubonekele ku bantu pakwebati babone ifikitwa fyenu ifyabune no kuleka Wishinwe wa mwiulu akindikilwemo.<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na mafunde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />“Mwile kutontonkanya ati naisa mukonaula mafunde nangula bakasesema, nomba naisa mu kuyafikilishapo. <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />Pantu nkomyeba ati mpaka iulu ne sonde fikapita, tapakabepo ikilembo nangula akalitoni kamo akengafumishiwamo mpaka fyonse fikafishiwepo. <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Ekyo onse uwasuulapo limo pa mafunde no kufunda bambi ifyo fine, akakuutwa uwakupelekeshako mu Bufumu bwa mwiulu. Nomba uyo uleyakonka no kufundako bambi akakuutwa umukindami mu Bufumu bwa mwiulu. <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />Ekyo nkomyeba, kano fye ubololoke bwenu bwakishapo pa Bafalise na bakafundisha bamafunde, nga tefyo tamwakengilemo mu Bufumu bwa mwiulu.”<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isambilisho palwa kikani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:57-59">Luka12.57-59</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />“Mwalyumfwa ifyo kyalandilwe kuba kale ati, ‘Wile kwipaya, noyo onse uwaipaya ali lingilwe ukupingulwa.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Nomba nkomyeba ati, onse uwafulilwa wabo akapingulwa. Kabili onse uwaeba wabo ati, ‘We kingulyalya we,’ akaya mu kilye elo no waeba wabo ati, ‘Uli kyungwa!’ akesa kuba mu busanso bwa kupooswa mu ngehena. <verse eid="MAT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />Ekyo, ulo ukoya mu kupeele kyabupe kyobe elo waibusha ati wenu alipo ne kintu ku mutima pali webo, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />ngale ushe kyabupe kyobe pantanshi ya kipailo, muye kuiwikisha na wenu elo wise kupeela ikyabupe kyobe. <verse eid="MAT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />Lanshanyeni kangu kangu no mulwani obe ulo talakufisha kuli kapingula, kapingula naye ulo talakutwala kuli kalinda wa kifungo, elo naye kalinda wa kifungo kuti akupoosa mu kifungo. <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />Nkomyeba mukine ati, tawakafumemo panka ukalipile indalama shonse.<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isambilosho lyapa bukende</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />“Mwalyumfwa ifyo kyalandilwe ati, ‘Wile kukita bukende.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Nomba nkomyeba ati, onse uwa lolesha umwanakashi no lunkumbwa lwabubi ninshi akita nakwe ubukende mu mutima wakwe. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Ilinso lyobe lya kumulyo nga lya kulengela ukubembuka, ulilobolemo ulipoose. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Ukuboko kobe kwa mulyo nga kwa kulengela ukubembuka, kuputuleko ukupoose. Kya kuwamina ukulufya ikilundwa kimo, ukukila ukuya ne filundwa fyonse mu ngehena.<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isambilisho palwa kulekana mu kyupo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:9">Mateyo19.9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mako10.11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luka16.18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />“Kyalyebelwe ati, umwalalume onse pa kuleka umukashi, alingile ukumulembela inkalata ya kupwilapo ikyupo. <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Nomba nebo nkomyeba ati, onse uwaleka umukashi wakwe ninshi amulengela ukukita ubukende kano fye nga amusanga mu bupulumushi, no waupa uobaleka naye akita ubukende.<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isambilisho palwa milapo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />“Kabili mwalyumfwa uko abantu ba kale bayebelwe ati, ‘Wile kulapa ifyabufi, fikilisha ikyo walaya kuli Shikulu.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Nomba nebo nkomyebati, Mwile kulapa nangula liulu line, pantu ekipuna kyakwa Lesa. <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />Tekulapa nangula isonde pantu ekapuna ka makasa yakwe. Mwile kulapa nangula fye ni pali Yelusalemu wine pantu e Musumba wa Mfumu ikindami. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Wile kulapa ku mutwi obe apo taungalenga umushishi umo ukutuba nangu ukufiita. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Webo ulande fye nga ni ‘ee’ nangula ‘ayii,’ pantu ikyakukila po ninshi kyakufuma ku mubifi.<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isambilisho palwa kilandushi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Luka6.29-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />“Mwalyumfwa uko kyaebelwe ati, ‘Ilinso pa linso, ilino pa lino.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Nomba nebo nkomyeba ati, mwile kupansana no muntu wabubi. Umfwa umo nga kupama ulupi kwitobo lya ku mulyo umupeele ne lya kuli kipiko apameko. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Uwakutwala mukilye pa ku fwaya ukukupokolola umwingila, leka sende ne kyakuifimba kyobe. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />Uwakupatikisha ukwenda nakwe umulundu umo, wende nakwe imilundu ibili. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />Peela ku ukokulomba, kabili wimutana uukofwaya ukwashimako kuli webo.<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukutemwa balwani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Luka6.27-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />“Mwalyumfwa uko kyalandilwe ati, ‘Temwa umunobe, umulwani obe ena umupate.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Nomba nebo nkomyeba ati, temweni abalwani benu no kupepelako abakomipakasa, <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />elo mukesakuba bana bakwa Wishinwe wa mwiulu, uulenga akasuba ukubalika pa babubi na pa babune, atuma imfula pa babune napa babubi. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Nga watemwa fye abakutemwa, kilambu ndo ukwete apo fyeke fyo efikita na bakasonkesha? <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Umfwa ukoposha fye bawenu beka, nindo wakita ukukila pa bataishiba Lesa? <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Ekyo mube abakupwililika nge fyo wishinwe wa mwiulu naye aba uwakupwililika.<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s">Isambilisho palwa kwafwako abalanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />“Kengeleni mwile kukita ikyabune pa kubonwa ku bantu. Nga mwakite fyo ninshi tapalipo kilambu mukakwatapo kuli wishinwe wa mwiulu. <verse eid="MAT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />Ulo wapeeela ku wakubulwa, wibilisha ku bantu nge fyo babumbimunda bakita mu ma Sinagoge na mu misebo pa kutashiwa ku bantu. Nkomyebati balipokelela libela ikilambu ku bantu. <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />Nomba ulo wapeeela ku wakubulwa wileka ukuboko kwa ku kipiko kwishibile ikyo ukwa mulyo kukokita. <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />Epakwebati ukupeela kobe kube mu nkaama. Elo Wishinwe uubona mu nkaama akakulambula.”<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isambilisho palwa mapepo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luka11.2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />Kabili ulo mu kopepa, mwile kuba nga babumbimunda abatemwa ukwimakana pa kupepela mu ma Sinagoge na mu misebo pa kubonwa ku bantu. Mukine balipokela limo ikilambu kyonse. <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Nomba webo pakupepa, kabuye mu muputule mobe wisaleko ne kiibi elo upepe kuli wiso uubona mu nkaama, akakulambula. <verse eid="MAT 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />Kabili ulo mukopepa mwile kulabaila nge fyo abataishiba Lesa bakita, pantu batontonkanya ati muli kyo emo bengomfwiwa. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />Mwile kubapashanya pantu wishinwe alishibile ifyo mukokabila ulo tamulati kumulomba. <verse eid="MAT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />Fyeke fi efyo mulingile ukule kupepa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">We Tata we waba mwiulu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:9">Likindikwe shina lyobe.<verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />Ubufumu bobe bwise,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:10">ubufwayo bobe bukitikwe pesonde nge fyo kyaba mwiulu.<verse eid="MAT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />Utupeelepo lelo ikyakulya kyanshiku shonse.<verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />Utwelele ifyakubifya fyesu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:12">nge fyo na fwebo twelela abatubifya.<verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />Witutwala mu mesho ayakulu, nomba utupusushe kumubifi.<verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />“Ekyo nga mwaelela abakomibifya, wishinwe mwiulu naye akamyelela. <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />Nomba nga teti mubelele, shinwe mwiulu naye tekuti amyelele.”<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isambilisho palwa mafungo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />“Ulo mukofunga mwi boneka ubulanda ngefyo babumbimunda bakita. Balaponya ifinso pa kuilanga ku bantu ati bakofunga. Mukine na myebati, ikilambu kyabo kyonse balipokelele kale. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Ulo mukofunga, subeniko amafuta ku mutwi no kusambika pa kinso, <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />pakwebati kiboneka ku bantu ati ukofunga, kano fye kuli wiso uutaboneka, uubona mu nkaama, eu ka kulambula.”<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ifyuma mwiulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Luka12.33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />“Mwile kututila fyuma fyenu pesonde, apo impese ne ndalabwa fingonaula kabili apo abang'o ba pantula no kwiba. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />Tutileni fyuma mwiulu umo impese, ne ndalabwa shita ngonaula, umo na bang'o tabangatibula no kwiba. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Pantu ukuli ikyuma kyobe ekuba no mutima obe.<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulubuuto lwa mubili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Luka11.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />“Ilinso e musaniko wa mubili, amenso yobe nga yali umutende, umubili onse ukesulamo ulubuuto. <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />Nomba amenso nga tayali bwino, umubili onse ukaba mu mfinshi. Ekyo ulubuuto muli mwebo ngalwali ni mfinshi, iyo mfinshi kuti yaba ikulu sana!”<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lesa ne fyuma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luka16.13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">12.22-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />“Tapalipo engabombela imfumu shibili, kuti apatapo imo no kutemwapo imbi, nangula ukuipelesha kuli imo no kufuupula iinakwe. Teti mubombele Lesa ne ndalama pa kashita kamo kene.”<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwile kusakamana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />“Ekyo mwisakamikwa pabumi bwenu nefyo mungalya nangula ukunwa nangu fyakufwala ku mubili, pantu umweo ulikindaminepo pa kyakulya no mubili ulikindaminepo pa fyakufwala. <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Lolesheni pafyo utoni mwiulu ututalima nangula ukututila mu matala, nomba wishinwe wa mwiulu alatuliisha. Bushe tamuli bamutengo ukukilapo? <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Ni nani pali mwebo angalundapo inshiku shakwe pantu akosakamikwa?” <verse eid="MAT 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />“Nindo mukosakamikilwa palwa mifwalile? Boneni ifyo amaluba yamena, tayabomba nangula kupikula. <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />Nomba nkomyebati nangula ni Solomoni wine mu bukindami bwakwe, tasamikilwepo nga yalya. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Ngefi efyo Lesa afwika ifyani ifyakubapo fye lelo, mailo fya pooswa mu mulilo, kuti afilwa ukumiliisha mweba kiteketelo kyakukepa?” <verse eid="MAT 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />“Ekyo mwile kusakamikwa pafyo mungalya, ifyo munganwa, ne fyakufwala. <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />Pantu abataishiba Lesa efyo bafwaisha lonse nomba wishinwe mwiulu alishibile ati mukofikabila. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />Nomba mwebo ngale fwayeni Ubufumu bwa mwiulu no bololoke bwakwe elo fyonse fikalundwapo kupeelwa kuli mwebo. <verse eid="MAT 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />Mwile kusakamikwa pafya mailo pantu ifiine fikaibwena. Kila bushiku buli ikwatile amasakamiko yabuko.”<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s">Wipingula abanobe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:37-38">Luka6.37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />“Mwile kupingwila abanenu pantu na mwebo mukapingulwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />Mufyo mupingwila bambi efyo na mwebo mukapingulwa mukipimo kimo kine. <verse eid="MAT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />Nindo ukobwena akapande mu linso lya munobe ulo pa linso lyobe pali ikipampa? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Kuti waeba shani wenu ati isa nkufumye akapande mu linso lyobe apo na webo ulikwete kipampa? <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />We bumbimunda we, ubalilepo ukufumya ikili mu linso lyobe elo ukobwenekesha pa kufumya akali mu linso lyakwa wenu.<verse eid="MAT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />“Mwipeela ikya mushilo ku mbwa, epali sha myalukila no kumisansa. Mwipeela ulubwe lwa mutengo ku nkumba epali sha nyantaulapo fye.”<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lomba, fwaya, konkonsha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luka11.9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />Lomba, ukapeelwa, fwaya, ukasanga, konkonsha ne kiibi kikesukila kuli webo. <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />Pantu onse uulomba alapeelwa, no ufwaya alasanga, naye uukonkonsha aleswilwako. <verse eid="MAT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />Ni nani pali mwebo umwana nga akulomba umukate engamupe libwe? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Nangula nga lomba isabi, engamupeela insoka? <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Umfwa mwe babubi nga mulishibile ukupeela abana ifyabune, nga wishinwe mwiulu ta enga peela ifyabupe fyabune ku ba mulomba? <verse eid="MAT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />Ekyo muli fyonse, mukitile bambi ifyo munga fwaya ukukitilwa pantu ekufishapo ifyalembwa mu mafunde na bakasesema.<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umwenshi wa kufyenekana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:24">Luka13.24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />Mule kwingilila pa mwenshi wa kufyenekana pantu uwakusaalala wena utwala kuboni kabili bengi bendelamo. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Nomba umwenshi uwakufyenekana utwala ku mweo kabili banini bendamo.<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikimuti ne fisabo fya kiko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Luka6.43-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />Mule kukengela na bakasesema wabufi. Beshila mu fyakufwala fya mbelele nomba mukati mimbulu iyakutakanya. <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Bakeshibikilwa ku fisabo fyabo. Bushe abantu kuti baswa imyangashi ku kimuti kya myunga? Nangu amakunyu kuli bakilasa? <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Efyo ikimuti kyonse ikitatwala fisabo fyabune kitwala ifyabubi. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />Ikimuti kyabune teti kitwale ifisabo fyabubi. Ikimuti kyabubi takingatwala ifisabo fya bune. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Ikimuti kyonse ikitatwala ifisabo ku kitema no kukiposa mu mulilo.<verse eid="MAT 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Ekyo mu kabeshibila ku fisabo fyabo.<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntakwishibilepo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Luka13.25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />“Teonse ungangebati, ‘Shikulu, Shikulu’ akengila mu Bufumu bwa mwiulu, kano fye abakita ifyo Tata wa mwiulu afwaya. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />Abengi pali bulya bushiku bakesa kungebati, ‘Shikulu, Shikulu, bushe tatwaseseme no kufumye fibanda mwishina lyobe, no kukita ifisungusho ifingi?’ <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Nandibo nkesa kubeba mukine ati, ‘Ntamishibilepo, fumeni pano mwe mbifi mwe!’<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bakakuula ba mayanda babili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Luka6.47-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />“Ekyo uyo onse uumfwa ikyebo kyangi no ku kikita akaba ngo wa mano uwakulile ing'anda yakwe pebwe. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Ulo inika shaiswile shalipangile ilyenshi, no mwela uukulu pa kupuma pali ilya ng'anda, nomba ta ya bongolokele pantu mufula wali pebwe.<verse eid="MAT 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />“Nomba uyo uumfwa ikyebo kyangi ukwakubula ukukikita, aba ngo muntu ikyungwa, uwa kulile ing'anda pa mukyanga. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Imfula ulo yalokele, kyaama kyalishile, no mwela uukulu waisa kupumapo, ukubongoloka kwaiko kwali kulile sana.”<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abantu kyabapapusha pa mifundile yakwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Yesu pa kupwisha ishi nsoselo, abantu bali kupapa fye pa masambilisho yakwe. <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />Pantu alibafundile nga umo wali na maka sana, tali kuba nga bakafundisha babo.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesu aposha uwafibashi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mako1.40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luka5.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Ulo Yesu alikutentemukile lupili na bantu abakuti ubwingi balimukonkele. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Elo uwafibashi alimufukamine ati, “Mukwai nga mukofwaya lekeni nsangululwe kuli mwebo.”<verse eid="MAT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Yesu naye epakutambalikapo ukuboko kwakwe no kumwikata ati, “Nkofwaya, sanguluwa.” Pekapo no wafibashi alisangulukile. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Elo Yesu alimwebele ati, “Witulisha ili lyashi ku muntu nangula umo. Kailange fye kuli nshimapepo no kupeela ikyabupe ikyo Mose amyebele pa kwebati abantu bashininkishe ukuposhiwa kobe.”<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aposha umusha wa mukulu wa fita</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luka7.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Pa kwingila mu Kapenamu, Yesu bamukumanya ku mukulu wa fita amweba ati, <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />“Mukwai, umubomfi wangi alilwele ubulebe, alele fye ku ng'anda akokalipwa sana.”<verse eid="MAT 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Elo Yesu alyasukile ati, “Nkoisa kumuposha.”<verse eid="MAT 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />Umukulu wa fita alimwasukile ati, Shikulu takilingile ati webo wise kwingila mwangi mung'anda, nomba landa fye shiwi lyeka no mubomfi wangi akoposhiwa. <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />Pantu nandibo ndanakila kubakulu pali nebo. Ndikwetepo na bashilika abanakila kuli nebo, nga naeba umo ati, “Kabuye,” naye kuya. Nga naeba umbi ati, “Isa kuno,” naye kwisa. Ikyo naeba umubomfi wangi ekyo akita.<verse eid="MAT 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Yesu pa kumfwe fyo kyalimupapwishe. Epakweba abali kumukonka ati, “Mukine fye ntatala sangapo ikiteketelo ikyakukula ngeki muli Islaeli onse. <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />Nkomyeba, abengi baka fumina ku kabanga na ku mbonshi, no kwikala na Ablahamu, Isaki na Yakobo pa mutebeto wa mu Bufumu bwa mwiulu. <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />Nomba abana ba Bufumu bena bakapooswa mu mfinshi umo bakalekulila no kusumanya ameno.” <verse eid="MAT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Yesu epakweba ikita ati, “Kabuye kobe, fikokitika nge fyofine uteketele.” Pekapo, umubomfi alipolele.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aposha abali kulwala abengi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mako1.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luka4.38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Ulo Yesu aile ku ng'anda kwa Petelo alisangileko nyinafyala lyakwa Petelo alilwele mpepo. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Epakumwikata pa kuboko. Pekapo, no bulwele bwa mpepo bwali fuminemo, a alamuka, atampa no ku mutangata.<verse eid="MAT 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Pa kyungulo, bamuleteele abengi abali ne fibanda, naye alitamfishemo imipashi yabubi ukubomfye kyebo. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />Epakufikilisha ikyo kasesema Isaya alandile ati, “Alisendele amalwele yesu yonse no kukonswa konse.”<verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abakesa kukonka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luka9.57-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Ulo Yesu abwene ibumba lya mushingulukile, alyebele abasambi bakwe ukuya bushilya bwa bemba. <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Kafundisha wa mafunde umo alishile no kweba Yesu ati, “kasambilisha nkokukonka konse ukoya.”<verse eid="MAT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Yesu naye alimwasukile ati, “Bamumbwe balikwetepo imimba no tuni tulikwetepo ifinsa, nomba u Mwana wa Muntu ena takwatapo na pa kusaika umutwi.”<verse eid="MAT 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />Umusambi umbi naye alyebele Yesu ati, “Shikulu lekeni ngale nge kushiika batata.”<verse eid="MAT 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Yesu alimwasukile ati, “Leka abakufwa baye kushiika abakufwa banabo, nomba webo twende unkonke.”<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atalalika maaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mako4.35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luka8.22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Elo Yesu apateme mu bwange, na basambi bakwe bali mukonkele. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Kabili palya penefye pali bemba palimine ikipuupu ikukulu ikyakuti amaaba yakoima na menshi ukule kwingila mu bwange, apo ninshi Yesu alilele mu bwange. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Abasambi epakwalamusha Yesu no kumwebati, “Shikulu, tupusushe tukofwa!”<verse eid="MAT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />Epakubeba ati, “Mweba kiteketelo kinini, nindo mwakwatilo mwenso?” Elo alimakene no kukalipila ikipuupu na maaba na bemba alitalele tondolo.<verse eid="MAT 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Abasambi abali nakwe balipapile ikyakwebati batampile no kule kwipusha ati, “Muntu wakuba shani uwakwebati ikipuupu na maaba fikomunakila!”<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atamfya ifibanda mu bantu babili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mako5.1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luka8.26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Ulo Yesu afikile mu kyalo kya Gadala, bushilya bwa bemba, balimukumenye ku baume babili abafumine mu nshishi, abali ne fibanda, abakukalipisha ikyakuti takwalipo angapitako muli ilyenshila. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Pamuku umowine balipundile ati, “Nindo ukofwaya kuli fwebo, Yesu Mwana Lesa? Waisa mu kutukanda ulo inshita tailati kufika?”<verse eid="MAT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Akatalamukila fye palipo umukuni uukulu wa nkumba ishali shikolya. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Ifibanda fyali papatile Yesu ati, “Ngamukotutamfya tutumeni tuye mu mukuni wa nkumba.”<verse eid="MAT 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Naye Yesu epakufitamfishamo. No mukuni onse wali swatukile mu matelo ya lupili no kuipoosa muli bemba no kufwila mu menshi.<verse eid="MAT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Ulo abakemi bankumba babutukile, baile kushimikila abekashi bamuli ulya musumba fyonse ifyakitikile ku bantu bali ne fibanda. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Abantu bonse baile kuli Yesu no kumupapata ati afumemo mu kyalo kyabo.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu aposha uwabulebe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mako2.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luka5.17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Kabili Yesu pa kupatama mu bwange pa kubwekelamo, aile bushilya bwa bemba, mu musumba mwakwe. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Eko bamuleteele umuntu walwele ubulebe ninshi alilele pamalo. Pa kubona ifyo bamuteketele, Yesu alyebele uwabulebe ati, “We mwana, sansamuka apo imembu shobe shaelelwa.”<verse eid="MAT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Pali kyo, bakafundisha bamafunde balikuisosha ati, “Uyu muntu akopontela Lesa.”<verse eid="MAT 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />Na Yesu pa kwishiba amatontonkanyo yabo alibebele ati, “Nindo mukotontonkanisha ifya bubi mu mitima yenu? <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />Ikyakwanguka apa kindo? Ukwebati, ‘Imembu shobe shaelelwa’ nangula ukwebati, ‘Alamuka wende.’ <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />Epakwebati mwishibe ati Umwana wa Muntu alikwete amaka pesonde ayakwelela imembu.” Epakweba uwabulebe ati, “Alamuka, senda malo yobe, kabuye kobe kung'anda.”<verse eid="MAT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Naye epakuya kwakwe kung'anda. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Ulo ibumba lyabwene fi, balipapile sana no kule kulumba Lesa awapeela maka ku bantu.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuuta Mateyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mako2.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luka5.27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Ulo Yesu afuminepo, epakubona umwalalume uweshina lya Mateyo, alikele mung'anda ya musonko. Epakumweba ati, “Nkonka.” Naye epakwima no kumukonka.<verse eid="MAT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Ulo Yesu bali kulya mung'anda mwaishilepo bakasonkesha na babembu balikele panshi pamo na basambi bakwe. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />Abafalise pa kubone fi balyebele abasambi bakwe ati, “Nindo kafundisha wenu alila pamo na bakasonkesha na babembu?”<verse eid="MAT 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Yesu pa kumfwe fyo alibebele ati, “Abatuntulu tabakabila kondapa kano fye abakulwala. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Nomba kabuyeni no kusambilila umo iki kyapilibwila, ‘Nkabila uluse temalambo,’ ntaishile mu ku kuuta abololoke, kano ababembu.”<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikipusho palwa mafungo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mako2.18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luka5.33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Abasambi bakwa Yowane pa kwisa kuli Yesu balimwipwishe ati, “Nindo fwebo na Bafalise tufungila ilingi nomba abasambi bobe nindo batafungila?”<verse eid="MAT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Yesu alibasukile ati, “Bushe nshindikishi shakwa nshibwinga shibe no bulanda ulo shili pamo na nshibwinga? Nomba inshita ikesa elo nshibwinga akasendwa, ulo lwena kulekufunga.<verse eid="MAT 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />“Tapangaba nangu umo angabika ikikamba ikipya pa nsalu yakifuusha, epali ikikamba kipya kyaisakulepula insalu ne kipunda kyakulilako. <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Ekyo tekuti babike umwangashi uutabila munsupa ishakukota, epali shalepuka no mwangashi waitika, waonaikila pamo ne nsupa. Nomba balongesha umwangashi uutabila munsupa ishipya, epakupususha fyonse fibili.”<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu abuusha kisotwe kubakufwa kabili aposha umwanakashi wa bulwele bwa mukunko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mako5.21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luka8.40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Ulo Yesu ali kulanda ifyo, palishilepo intungulushi ya Bayuda imo, ya mufukamina, yalimwebele ati, “Umwana wangi kisotwe afwa, nomba wise ngale umutambikepo ukuboko, epakwebati abe umutuntulu.”<verse eid="MAT 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Naye Yesu na basambi bakwe epakumukonka.<verse eid="MAT 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Elo umwanakashi uwali kulwala umukunko pa myaka ikumi limo naibili naye alikonkele mu numa, no kwisa kwikata ku lusempe lwa nsalu yakwa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />Pantu mu mutima alyebele ati, “Nga nkumyeko fye ku nsalu yakwe, nkopola.”<verse eid="MAT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Yesu pa kupilibuka, amubona, amweba ati, We mwana wangi, koseleshiwa apo ikiteketelo kyobe kilikuposeshe. Pekapo umwanakashi alipolele.<verse eid="MAT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Yesu pa kwingila mung'anda ya ntungulushi alisangilemo bakalisha bakipolilo na bali kuloosha. <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />Yesu epakubeba ati, “Fumineni panse, uyu kisotwe tafwile, alilele fye mutulo.” Elo balamuseka. <verse eid="MAT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Ulo abantu bafumine panse, elo aingilemo no kwikata kisotwe pa kuboko, naye epakwalamuka. <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Ne lyashi lya kya kitikile lya sabankanine mu kyalo kyonse.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aposha impofu shibili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Yesu pakufumapo, abalalume babili abali ni mpofu balimukonkele bakopunda ati, “Yesu mwana David, utulangulukileko!”<verse eid="MAT 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Ulo Yesu aingile mukati, impofu shilya shibili shalimukonkele, naye epakushipusha ati, “Bushe mukoteketela ati nebo kuti namiposha?” Nasho shalimwasukile ati, “Ee mukwai!”<verse eid="MAT 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Epakushikata pa menso, Yesu alishebele ati, “Nakibe ngefyo muteketele!” <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />Pekapo amenso yabo yalisukile no kwamba ukubona. Yesu epakubebekesha ati, “Mwiebako muntu nangu umo ikyakitwa pano.”<verse eid="MAT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Nomba bena pakufumapo, balisabankenye ilyashi pali Yesu kubekashi bonse aba mukiputulwa kya kilya kyalo.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aposha kibuulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Ulo bali kufuma, abantu bambi baliletele kuli Yesu umuntu uutali kulanda pantu ali ne kibanda. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Panuma atamfyamo ikibanda, pekapo umuntu epakwambako ukulanda. Bonse balipapile bakoebati, “Tatwabonapo ikyakubefi mu Islaeli!”<verse eid="MAT 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Nomba Abafalise bena balyebele ati, “Ni ku maka ya kibanda kikulu eko atamfisha ifibanda.”<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aumfwe nkumbu pa bantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />Ulo Yesu ali kutandalila bantu mu misumba na mu mishi. Alikufunda mu ma Sinagoge no kulekubila Imbila Yabune iya Bufumu, no kulekuposha amalwele ya kupusana pusana no ku konswa konse. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />Ulo abwene abantu abakuti ubwingi, alibakwatile inkumbu, pantu bali abatakaniwa, abapelelwa kubati ni mbelele shakubulwa kakema. <verse eid="MAT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />Elo aebele abasambi bakwe ati, “Ubusomboshi buli kulile, nomba ababomfi bali kepele. <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />Ekyo pepeni kuli Shikulu umwine wa busomboshi, pakwebati engatumako ababomfi mwibala lya busomboshi bwakwe.”<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s">Abatumwa ikumi na babili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mako16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luka6.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />Yesu ali kuutile abasambi ikumi limo na babili no kubapeela maka ya kuposha malwele no kukonswa konse. <verse eid="MAT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Aya e mashina ya basambi bonse ikumi limo na babili: Uwakwambilapo ni Simoni, uwali kwitikwa ati, Petelo na wabo Andeleya, Yakobo mwana Sebede na wabo Yowane, <verse eid="MAT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />Filipo na Batolomeo, Toma na Mateyo kasonkesha, Yakobo mwana Alufeyo na Tandeo, <verse eid="MAT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />Simoni uwali kuba mwi bumba lya Baseloti na Yuda Iskalioti uwamwalukiile.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atuma abasambi ikumi limo na babili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mako6.7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luka9.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Yesu alibatumine abasambi no kubebekesha ati, “Mwikaya munkende sha Benafyalo nangula ukwingila mu misumba ya bena Samalia. <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />Lelo muye fye ku bena Islaeli, imbelele shakuluba. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Ulo mukoya, mule kushimika ati, ‘Ubufumu bwa mwiulu buli palamine.’ <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Posheni abakolwala, busheni abakufwa, sangululeni abakuba ne fibashi, mule kutamfya ne fibanda. mwapokelela apafye peeleni apafye. <verse eid="MAT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />Mwi kasendapo indalama nangu imo mu fikwama. <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />Mwi kasendapo nangula kyola nangu malaya yabili, inkwabilo nangu fye ni nkonto. Pantu umubomfi alilingile ukupelwa ikyo akokabila.<verse eid="MAT 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />“Kabili mu musumba no mushi onse mukoyamo, fwayenimo umuntu uulingile epo muye kupulila no kwikalapo mpaka apo mukela. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />Landenimo umutende mung'anda mukoingila. <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />Pali ilya ng'anda nga palilingile, lekeni umutende wenu ubepo, nga tefyo lekeni umutende umibwelele. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Nga kwabako aba tanga misekelela nangula ukumfwa kuli mwebo, pa kufumapo kunteni ulukungu ku makasa yenu. <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />Nkomyeba mukine ati, pa bushiku bwa bupingushi kikesa kubako mwakubela kuli Sodoma na Gomola ukukila pali ulya musumba.<verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukupakaswa ku koisa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mako6.7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:16">Luka9.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />“Boneni, nkomituma nge mbelele pakati ka mimbulu, mule kukengela kubati ni nsoka, mule kufuuka kubati ni nkunda. <verse eid="MAT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />Mule kuiteyanya, pantu bakamikata no kumitwala mufilye no ku mipumawila mu ma Sinagoge. <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />Kabili bakamitwala ku balashi na kuli bashamfumu epakuba bakamboni bangi kuli bena elo na ku Benafyalo. <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />Nomba nga bamitwala mu kilye, mwi kasakamikwa pafyo mukalanda, pantu pekapo mukebwa ifya kulanda. <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />Temwebo mukalanda, ni Mupashi wakwa shinwe eukale kulanda ukupitila muli mwebo.<verse eid="MAT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />“Wabo akepaisha wabo, wishi naye akepaisha umwana, abana bakemina abafyashi no kubepaisha. <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />Abantu bonse bakamipatilapo pe shina lyangi, nomba uyo akashipikisha ukushinta ku mpelekesho eukesa kupusuka. <verse eid="MAT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />Ulo mwa pakaswa ku bantu ba mu musumba umo, fulumukileni kuli umbi, nkomyeba ati, ulo mutalapitamo mu misumba yonse iya Islaeli, Umwana wa Muntu ninshi alifikile.<verse eid="MAT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />“Takwabapo umusambi uwakukila kafundisha wakwe. Elo umusha naye tangakilapo shikulu wakwe. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />Umusambi kuti kyamulingila fye ukuba nga kafundisha wakwe elo umusha naye nga shikulu wakwe. Apo bali kukuuta umwine wa ng'anda ati ni Beelesebu, nomba pa ba mung'anda yakwe pena enkile.<verse eid="MAT 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ni nani uwakutiina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Luka12.2-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />“Mwile kubatiina. Tapalipo ikyakufisama iki takasokoloke nangula ikya kufisama iki takeshibwe. <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />Ifyo nalanda kuli mwebo mu mfinshi mwebo muka filandila pa kampalabwa, Ikyo mukomfwa bakolandila mu kantepentepe, muka kipundile pa mitenge. <verse eid="MAT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />Mwile kutiina abepaya fye umubili nomba teti bepayepo umweo. Mulekutiina fye uungonaula umubili no mweo no ku fipoosa mu ngehena. <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />Bushe inseeba shibili tashishitishiwa fye pa ndalama iinini? Nomba pali utu tapalipo akaponena panshi ukwakubula ukwishibwa kuli ba wiso. <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Apo fye ne mishishi ya mu mitwi yenu yalipendwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Ekyo mwilekuba no mwenso apo muli kindeme ukukila napa nseeba ishakuti ubwingi.<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukushimbula no ku kaana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:8-9">Luka12.8-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />“Umuntu onse uutaba na mwenso pa kunshimbula pa bantu, nandibo nkesa kumushimbula pa kinso kyakwa Tata wa mwiulu. <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />No ukankana pa kinso kya bantu nandibo nkesa kumukanina pa kinso kyakwa Tata wa mwiulu.<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Temutende, lupanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luka12.51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14.26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />“Mwile tontonkanya ati naisa mukuleta umutende pesonde, ayii. Naletapo fye ulupanga. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />Naisa mu kupusanya umwalalume na wishi, no mwana mwanakashi na nyina, umulokashi na nyinafyala. <verse eid="MAT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />Mung'anda ya muntu emukasangwapo abalwani bakwe.<verse eid="MAT 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />“Uwatemwishapo wishi nangula nyina ukukilapo pali nebo, nangu umwalalume napamo umwanamwanakashi, talingile kuba umusambi wangi. <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />No utasenda ulupanda lwakwe, talingile kuba umusambi wangi. <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />Uyo onse afwaya ukubakilila umweo wakwe ali no kuulofya, nomba uukalofya umweo wakwe pali nebo, akausanga.<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ifilambu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:41">Mako9.41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />“Uwasekelela mwebo, asekelela nebo, no wansekelela ninshi asekelela uwantumine. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Uyo onse uwasekelela kasesema pantu fye ni kasesema akapokako ikilambu kyakwa kasesema no wasekelela umuntu wa bololoke pantu fye mololoke, akapokelapo ikilambu kya muntu wa bololoke. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />Mukine fye, uyo onse uwapeeelako ulukombo lwa menshi ya kutalala kuli aba abakukepesha pantu fye basambi bangi, takalufyepo ikilambu.”<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="s">Yowane kabatisha atuma intumi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luka7.18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Ulo Yesu apwishishe ukwebekesha abasambi bakwe ikumi limo na babili, aile ku misumba ya palamineko iya mu Galile uko ali kufunda no kubila.<verse eid="MAT 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />Ulo Yowane ali mu kifungo, alyumfwile ifyo Klistu ali kukita, epakutumako abasambi bakwe. <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />Baile kwipusha Yesu ati, “Bushe ni webo walingilile ukwisa nangula tule kupembelela umbi?”<verse eid="MAT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Yesu alibasukile ati, “Bwekelenimo kuli Yowane muye kumweba ifyo mu koumfwa no kubona, <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />impofu shikobona, ne filema fikoenda, abakuba ne fibashi bakosanguluka, na bankomyamatwi bakoumfwa, abakufwa bakoba no mweo, na balanda bakobililwa Imbila Yabune. <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Wakushuka uutaipuntula pa mulandu wangi.”<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />Ulo abatuminwe bali mu kubwekelamo, Yesu naye epakutampa ukulanda ku ma bumba pali Yowane: “Ulo mwaile kuli Yowane mu kiswebebe, nindo mwaile kubonako? Litete ilyakupungaila ku mwela?” <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Nindo mwaile kubona? Muntu wafwele nsalu shabune? Abafwala ifyo ni balya basangwa kufipango fya mfumu. <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Ngebeniko, nindo mwaile kubona? bushe ni Kasesema? Emukwai, kabili uwakukilapo napali kasesema. <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />Pantu ni pali Yowane epo amalembo yalandila ati, Lesa alilandile ati, “Nkatuma intumi ku kumitangilila mu kumipekanishisha inshila. <verse eid="MAT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />Mukine kine nkomweba ati, Yowane kabatisha mukulupo pali bonse abana ba bantu abafyalwa ku banakashi. Nomba uwakupelekeshapo mu Bufumu bwa mwiulu ena alikililepo pali Yowane. <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />Ukufuma apo Yowane kabatisha ali kubila ukushinta pali nomba, Ubufumu bwa mwiulu bwa kulwila na babulwila ebabupoka ku maka. <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />Ukwisakushinta fye pali Yowane, bakasesema bonse na mafunde yakwa Mose yali kulanda pa Bufumu bwakwa Lesa. <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />Nga muli iteyenye ukusumina, Yowane wine e Eliya uwalino kwisa. <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Uuli na matwi ya kumfwa nga omfwe.<verse eid="MAT 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />“Ni kundo ni ngapalakanyako inkulo ino? Yakuba nga abaike abakoangala mu lubansa lwa kisankano, bakoikuuta ati, <verse eid="MAT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />‘Twamilishishe ulwimbo lwa bwinga, mwebo tamwakindile. Mpaka twa mimbila ikimbo kya malilo, kabili mwalikene ukuloosha.’ <verse eid="MAT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />Ulo Yowane alishile, tali kulya nangula ukunwa, bali kumweba ati aliba ne kibanda. <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Elo paisapo Umwana wa Muntu ali kulya no kunwa, bali kumweba ati, ‘kabunduulu kabili munwi, kibusa wa bakasonkesha na babembu.’ Nomba ifikitwa fya mano yakwa Lesa filashinika muli bukine bwa fitumbukamo.”<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imisumba iita lapile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luka10.13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Yesu akukalipila bantu mu misumba umo ali kupanga ifisungusho ifyakufula nomba tabalapile. <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />“Kalanda kuli webo Kolazine, na webo Betesaida! Ifisungusho fyakitikile muli mwebo afikitikila muli Turi na Sidoni nga kale balapile no kufwala amasaamu mwitoi! <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Nkokweba ati Lesa akalangulukilako abena Turi na bena Sidoni ukukila pali webo. <verse eid="MAT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />Na webo kapenamu, walyebele ati ukaitumpwila kwiulu? Ukesa kukulukila mu mukonko wamfwa. Ifisungusho fyakitikile muli webo afikitikilako mu Sodoma, nga epo akili na kali lelo. <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Ekyo wibushe ati, Lesa akalangulukilako abena Sodoma ukukilapo pali webo.”<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iseni kuli nebo elo mutuusheko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Luka10.21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Pali ilya nshita, Yesu alyebele ati, “Namitasha Tata mwe Mfumu ya mwiulu na pesonde apo mwafishile fi fintu kubakukengela na bamano elo mwaisa kufisokolola ku baike. <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Efyo Tata mwafwaile ati kibe.<verse eid="MAT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />“Tata fyonse alimpeela. Takulipo awaishiba Umwana kano fye Wishi. Kabili tapalipo uwaishiba Wishi kano fye Umwana nabo Umwana asalilepo ukusokolwela.<verse eid="MAT 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iseni kuli nebo no kutuusha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />“Iseni mwense mwe banakile pa kusenda ifipe fya kulema nandi nkomileka mutuusheko. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />Musende ikoli lyangi no kusambilishiwa kuli nebo apo naliba uwakunakilila no kuikefya mu mutima elo mukosangapo ukutuusha. <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />Pantu ikoli lyangi lyakwanguka, ne kipe kyangi kya kupepuka.”<verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s">Ikipusho palwa bushiku bwe Sabata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mako2.23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luka6.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />Ulo Yesu ali kupita mwibala lya ng'ano pa bushiku bwe Sabata, abasambi bakwe balyumfwile nsala, batampile ukutempula imitwi ya ng'ano bakolya. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />Abafalise pa kubone fyo, epakweba Yesu ati, “Bona abasambi bobe bakokita ikyabindwa pa bushiku bwe Sabata.”<verse eid="MAT 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />Yesu naye alibasukile ati, “Bushe tamwabelengapo ifyakitikile kuli Davidi pamo nabo alinabo ulo baumfwile nsala. <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />Alingile mung'anda yakwa Lesa, elo balilepo umukate wali kupeelwa kuli Lesa, nangula kyalibindilwe ukulyako kano fye banshimapepo beka. <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Nangu tamwabelengapo mu mafunde ukwebati banshimapepo mwi Tempele tabali kusunga ifunde, ukwakubulwa ukupelelwapo mulandu? <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />Nkomyeba ati pano palipo uwakukila pe Tempele. <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />Nga mwalishibile umwapilibwila ili lembo, ‘Luse ulo mfwaya temalambo, ayii,’ nga teti mwebaule uwakaele. <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />Pantu Umwana wa Muntu e Mfumu ye Sabata.”<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aposha uwa kisansa kya kulemana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mako3.1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luka6.6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />Yesu pa kufuma palya alingile mu Sinagoge. <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />Epakusangamo muntu wa kisansa kyakulemana. Mwalipo na bali kufwailisha apo bengamusangila no mulandu. Elo bamwipwishe ati, “Bushe kyalisuminishiwa ukuposha umuntu pe Sabata?”<verse eid="MAT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />Naye Yesu alibasukile ati, “Nga kyakwebati imbelele ya umo pali mwebo yalobela mu kilindi pe Sabata, ninshi talina kuifumyamo? <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Umuntu wa mutengo ukukilapo na pa mbelele! Ekyo kyansambu ukukita ikyabune pe Sabata.” <verse eid="MAT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Yesu epakweba uwali ne kisansa kya kulemana ati, “Fungulula ukuboko kobe.” Naye pa kufungulula abona kwapola, kwaba bwino nge fyali ukunakwe. <verse eid="MAT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Elo Abafalise pa kufumapo baya kupingana ifyo Yesu bangamwipaya.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umubomfi wasalilwe na Lesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Ulo Yesu aumfwile amapinge yabo ayakumwipaya, epakufumapo, na bantu abakuti ubwingi balimukonkele. Naye alibaposeshe bonse abali kulwala. <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />Kabili alibebekeshe ukwebati bemusokolola ku bantu bambi. <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />Akitile ikyo mu kukonka nefyo kasesema Isaya aebele ati:<verse eid="MAT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />“Uyu e mubomfi wangi uo nasalile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">uyo natemwa, kabili ni muli uyo emombekelwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">Nkamutumina Umupashi wangi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">kabili akesa kubila ubupingushi bwangi ku mishobo.<verse eid="MAT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />Tale kupansana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:19">nangula kule kupunda, nangu ukupundisha mu misebo<verse eid="MAT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />Takafune itete lya kupompoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">nangula ukushimya ulukuni ulutakomota mulilo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">Alino kushipikisha mpaka fye akaletepo mulinganya ku kukimfya.<verse eid="MAT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />Ni muli uyo emo bonse bakesa kusubila.”<verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Beelesebu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Mako3.20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luka11.14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Elo baletele umuntu umo kuli Yesu, uwali mpofu, kabili ali ni kibulu pantu ali ne fibanda. Yesu pa kumuposha, elo ulya muntu epakutampa ukulanda no kubona pa kashita kamo kene. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Amabumba yalisungukile pa fyo klistu akitile, bakoebana ati, “Bushe uyu tali ni mwana Davidi?”<verse eid="MAT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Abafalise pa kumfwe fyo balyasukile ati, “Atamfya ifibanda pantu ikibanda kikulu, Beelesebu ekimupeela maka yakubomba ifyo.”<verse eid="MAT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Yesu alishibile fyo bali kutontonkanya, epakubeba ati, “Ubufumu bonse umuli ukutakana teti bwimakane. Elo umusumba onse nangula ing'anda yonse iilwisha iyine ikapashinkana. <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />Ekyo Satana nga atamfya Satana ninshi akoilwisha umwine, no bufumu bwakwe teti bwimakane! <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Mungeba ati ntamfisha ifibanda ku maka yakwa Beelesebu, nga bantu benu baitamfisha ku maka yakwa nani? Ekyo abantu benu bene ebakomishinika. <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Tekumaka yakwa Beelesebu, ni ku maka ya Mupashi wakwa Lesa pa kumilangilila ati Ubufumu bwakwa Lesa bulishile pali mwebo.<verse eid="MAT 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />“Takulipo muntu ungengila mung'anda ya wa maka, no kutapa ifipe fyakwe kano ngale amukaka.<verse eid="MAT 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />“Onse uutali na nebo ninshi mulwani wangi, uuta kolonganya pamo na nebo, ninshi eukopalanganya. <verse eid="MAT 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />Ekyo nkomyeba ati, imembu shonse isho abantu bengakita kuti shaelelwa, nomba fye uwapontela Mupashi wa Mushilo ena teti elelwe. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Onse uwalanda ikyabubi pa Mwana wa Muntu, kuti aelelwa, nomba uwapontela Mupashi wa Mushilo teti elelwe, munkulo ino nangu iikesa kuntanshi.<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikimuti ne fisabo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luka6.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />“Pa kukwatapo ikisabo kyabune, kano pa bapo ikimuti kya bune, ikimuti nga kyabubi, ne fisabo nafyo ninshi fyabubi. Ikimuti kishibikilwa ku fisabo fyakiko. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Mwe bana bamafolo mwe, kuti mwalanda ifya bune mwe mbifi? Pantu akanwa kalanda ifyaisula mu mutima. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Umuntu wa bune afumya ifya bune mukipao kya bune, imbifi nayo ifumya ifyabubi mukipao kyabubifi.<verse eid="MAT 12:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />“Nkomyeba ati, umuntu onse pa bushiku bwa bupingushi akesa kupingulwa pe shiwi lonse basosele ili taba na buyo. <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />Amashiwi yenu yene ya kesa ku bomfeshiwa pa ku bona nga muli ba mulandu nangula tefyo.”<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bakabila ukubonapo ikishibilo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Mako8.11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luka11.29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Bakafundisha bamafunde bamo pamo na Bafalise baebele Yesu ati, “Tukofwaya ukubonapo ikishibilo kuli webo kasambilisha.”<verse eid="MAT 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />Naye alibasukile ati, “Inkulo ya bubifi, kabili iya bukende ikofwaye kishibilo, nomba taya kakibonepo kano fye ikishibilo kyakwa kasesema Yona. <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" />Nga filya Yona ali munda ya kisabi pa nshiku shitatu akasuba no bushiku efyo no Mwana wa Muntu akesa kuba mu mushili pa nshiku shitatu akasuba no bushiku. <verse eid="MAT 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />Pa bushiku bwa bupingushi, abena Ninefe bakesa kupingula inkulo ino, pantu bali lapile pa kumfwa imbila yakwa Yona. Nomba nkomyeba ati uwakukilapo pali Yona ali pano. <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />Kabili pa bushiku bwa bupingushi, Namfumu wa ku Sheba naye akesa kupingula mwebo pantu alyendele ukufuma ku kyalo kwakwe ukwisa kumfwa ku mano yakwa Solomoni. Nomba uwakukilapo pali Solomoni ali pano.<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukubweluluka kwa mipashi yabubi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luka11.24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />“Ulo umupashi wabubi nga wafuma mu muntu, uya ukosabanta mu nkende yakuuma ukufwaya apakutushisha, elo nga taupasangile, <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />ukalanda ati, ‘Nkobwekelemo ku ng'anda uko nali kwikala.’ Epakuyasanga ili pyangilwe tamulipo kintu muliweme. <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />Elo waya kusendapo imipashi yabubi inakwe kine lubali iya kubipa ukukilapo elo yonse yaisa kwikalamo. Nomba umubelo wa ulya muntu kwisa kubipilako ukukila pafyo ali kale. Efikaba ne nkulo ino iya bubifi.”<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyina na bawabo lyakwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mako3.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luka8.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Ulo Yesu ali kulanda kwi bumba lya bantu, nyina na bawabo lyakwa Yesu balishile kwimakana panse, ukufwaya ukwambaula nakwe. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Umo pali balya alyebele Yesu ati, “Banoko na bawenu bemakene panse bakofwaya ukwambaula na webo.”<verse eid="MAT 12:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Yesu alibasukile ati, “Nga bamayo nangula bawesu ni banani?” <verse eid="MAT 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Epakusonta ku basambi bakwe ati, “Aba e bamayo na bawesu. <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />Uyo onse ukita ukufwaya kwakwa Tata wa mwiulu e wesu ne nkashi yangi na mayo.”<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s">Umulumbe wakwa kakusa wa mbuto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mako4.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:48">Luka8.48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Pali bulya bwine bushiku, Yesu alifumine mung'anda ukuya kwikala mu mukulo wa bemba. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Ibumba ilikulu lyali kolongene ikyakwebati Yesu apateme mu bwange elo nomba abantu bena balishele ku mulundu. <verse eid="MAT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />Ali kubomfye milumbe pa ku basambilisha ifintu ifingi. Alyebele ati, “Umuntu umo alile mu kukusa imbuto. <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />Ulo ali kukusa, shimbi shaliponene mu nshila, ne fyuni fyalishile no kukibaula. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />Shimbi shaliponene pamushili wa kasakalabwe, apalipo fye umushili unini. Imbuto shali lulumukile, nomba apo mushili tawashikile, <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />Ulo akasuba kakumine, imbuto shamenene shalilalile pantu takwete mishila. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Shimbi nasho shaliponene mu myunga. Ulo imyunga yakulile yalitabilile mbuto shali kumena, nasho epakutola. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />Shimbi nasho shaliponene mu mushili wabune no kutwala ifisabo, shimbi shalitwele imiku mwanda umo, ne shinakwe imiku amakumi mutanda, elo shimbi shena shali amakumi yatatu yafya kushilwe.” <verse eid="MAT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />“Uuli na matwi, nga omfwe.”<verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umwapilibwile milumbe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mako4.10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luka8.9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Abasambi pa kwisa kuli Yesu balimwipwishe ati, “Nindo ubomfeshe milumbe pa kulanda ku bantu?”<verse eid="MAT 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />Yesu naye alibasukile ati, “Ubwishibilo bwa fya nkaama sha Bufumu bwa mwiulu bwalipeelwa kuli mwebo, nomba tekuli bena. <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />Pantu kuli onse ukwetepo fimo, akapeelelwapo na fimbi no kwisa kukwata ifingi. Nomba uyo utakwatapo, no tunini uto akwatapo tukesa kupokwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Ekyo nandila kuli bena mu milumbe nikyo balabona ukwakubulapo kwishiba, Kabili nangu bomfwe, teti beluke. <verse eid="MAT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />Ni kulya ba bantu ubusesemo bwakwa Isaya bwali kusonta:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">“Bale kumfwa nomba ukwakubulapo ukwiluka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:14">bale kubona nomba ukwakubulapo ubwishibilo.<verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />Pantu imitima yabo yali kutwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">na matwi tayomfwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">na menso nayena tayabona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">Epali babona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">na matwi yabo yaumfwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">na bakampingu babo bailuka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">elo bapindulukila kuli nebo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">epakwebati mbaposhe.”<verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />“Nomba mwebo mulishukile, apo amenso yenu yakobona. Na matwi yenu naye yakoumfwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />Nkomyeba mu kine ati, bakasesema na bololoke abengi bali kufwaisha ukubona ikyo mukobona, no kumfwa ifyo mukoumfwa, nomba balifililwe.<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umwapilibwila umulumbe wakwa kakusa wa mbuto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mako4.13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luka8.11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />“Umfweni umo umulumbe wakwa kakusa wa mbuto wapilibwila. <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />Abomfwa ku kyebo kya Bufumu bwakwa Lesa ukwakubulapo ukwiluka kwamo kilolele, e shilya mbuto shaponene mumbali ya nshila. Kiwa naye aisa kusompola ikyebo kya kushilwe mu mutima wakwe. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Imbuto shaponene pansakalabwe muntu umfwa ikyebo, akipokelela mu nsansa. <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />Nomba tamulipo mishila muli ena, kyaikalamo pakashita fye kanini. Ulo pali kilya kyebo paisapo ukupakaswa, kangu kangu anenuka. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />Imbuto shaponene mu myunga ni balya bomfwe kyebo, nomba masakamiko ya bwikashi, no kukonkelela kwa fyuma kwatosha kilya kyebo kyafilwa ukutwala ifisabo. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Nomba imbuto shaponene mu mushili wa bune bantu bomfwa ikyebo no kwiluka, epakutwala ne fisabo, bambi umwanda umo, bambi amakumi mutanda, elo bambi amakumi yatatu pafyo bakushile.”<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umulumbe wa nsaku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Yesu ali bebelepo umulumbe na umbi ati, “Ubufumu bwa mwiulu kuti twabupalakanyako ku muntu umo uwaile kukusa imbuto mwibala lyakwe. <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />Ulo abantu bonse balilele mutulo ubushuku, elo umulwani aisa kukusamo insaku no kuya aya. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Ulo Ing'ano pa kukula no kusakamuna, insaku nasho shalibonekele.” <verse eid="MAT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />Ababomfi ba ulya muntu balimwebele ati, “Bushe tali ni mbuto shabune sheka twakushile mwibala? Nomba ishinsaku shafumapi?” <verse eid="MAT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />Naye alibasukile ati, “Mulwani akitile fi.” Elo ababomfi balyebele ati, “Bushe tuye kushitupula?” <verse eid="MAT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />Naye alibebele ati, “Mwikite fyo epali mwatupwila kumo ne ng'ano. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Lekeni fikulile pamo mpakapo tukesa kusombwela. Elo nkesa kweba ababomfi ukubalishapo ukutupula insaku, ukushikaka imipo no kushokya mu mulilo elo ukukonkeshapo ing'ano no kushitutila mubutala bwangi.”<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umulumbe wa luseke lwa lubanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mako4.30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luka13.18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />Kabili Yesu epakubebapo mulumbe na umbi ati, “Ubufumu bwa mwiulu bwakubati luseke lwa lubanga ulo muntu abyele mwibala lyakwe. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />Nangula e luseke lwa kukepeshapo panseke shonse, nomba kilabe kimpukusa, elo kyakula, kisakuba ikimuti ikya kwebati no toni twaisa kubikako ifiinsa mu mitano yakiko.”<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umulumbe wa kitutumushi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:20-21">Luka13.20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />Yesu alibebele umulumbe naumbi ati, “Ubufumu bwa mwiulu bwakubati kitutumushi ikyo mwanakashi asankenye ifipimo fitatu ifyabunga mpaka apangamo no mufuba, watutuluka onse.”<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikyo Yesu ali kulandila mu milumbe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:33-34">Mako4.33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Fyonse fi Yesu ali kusosela mu milumbe kumabumba. Kabili talandilepo ku bantu ukwakubula ukubomfye milumbe. <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />Akitile fi pa kufikilishapo ifyo kasesema aebele ati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">“Nkale kumilandila mu milumbe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:35">Nkale kumyeba ifyafiseme ukutampa apo isonde lya lengelwe.”<verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ashimbulo mulumbe wa nsaku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Yesu pa kusha mabumba, elo aingile mung'anda. Abasambi bakwe epakumwipusha ati, “Bushe umulumbe wa nsaku wapilibwila mwisa?”<verse eid="MAT 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />Yesu naye alibasukile ati, “Uwabyele imbuto Mwana wa Muntu. <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />Ibala nalyo ni pesonde ne mbuto shabune bana ba mu Bufumu. Elo insaku bana bamubifi. <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />Umulwani akushilemo insaku ni Kiwa. Ubusomboshi ni mpela ye sonde. Abakusombola nabo ni bamalaika. <verse eid="MAT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />Nga filya bakolonganika insaku no kushokya mu mulilo, efyo kikesa kuba pa kupwa kwe sonde. <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />Umwana wa Muntu akatuma bamalaika bakwe ukwisa ku kolonganika imbifi ukubafumya mu Bufumu bwakwe, bonse abali kulenga abanabo ukukita ifyabubi na batomfwa, <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />bakapooswa mu mulilo emo bale kulila no kusumanya ameno. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Elo abololoke bena bakabalika kubati kasuba mu Bufumu bwakwa wishibo. Uuli na matwi ya kumfwa nga omfwe.<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umulumbe wa kipao kyafishilwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />“Kabili Ubufumu bwa mwiulu bwakuba nge kipao kyafishilwe mu kisonso, umuntu pa kukisanga akifisa, elo aya kushitisha fyonse akwete mpaka ayakushita kilya kisonso.<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umulumbe wa lubwe lwa mutengo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />“Kabili Ubufumu bwa mwiulu bwaliba kubati musulwishi uwali kufwaya ulubwe lwa mutengo ulwakubeeka sana. <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />Pa kulusanga, aya kushitisha fyonse ifyo akwete, epakushitamo na lulya lubwe.<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umulumbe wa mukwau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />“Kabili Ubufumu bwa mwiulu bwaliba kubati mukwau wapooselwe pali bemba no kwikata isabi ilya kupusana pusana. <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />Ulo umukwau waiswilemo isabi, abantu epakuufumisha ku mulundu, baikala panshi no kwabanye sabi. Ilya bune balibika mu miseke, nomba ilyabubi balilipoosele. <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />Efyo kikesa kuba pa kumpwa kwa kyalo. Bamalaika bakesa kupatulula imbifi ku bololoke, <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />no kubapoosa mwilungu lya mulilo emukesa kuba ukulila no kusumanya meno.”<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikine ikipya ne kyakukota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />Yesu epakubepusha ati, “Bushe fikoumfwanike fi fintu kuli mwebo?” Nabo balimwasukile ati, “Emukwai.”<verse eid="MAT 13:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />Yesu naye epakubeba ati, “Ekyo kafundisha wa Mafunde onse uuli umusambi wa Bufumu bwa mwiulu, ali ngo mwine wa ng'anda uufumya mukipao kyakwe ifipya ne fyakukota.”<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bamukaana ku Nasaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mako6.1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka4.16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Yesu ulo apwile ukubeba ilya milumbe, alibashiile. <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />Pakufika kwabo ku musumba, alibasambilishe mu Sinagoge. Abantu balipapile ati, “Nga ya mano na maka akokitilamo ifisungusho fyonse fi afumyapi? <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />Tali mwana fye wakwa kabasa wa mbao? Na nyina bushe tali ni ulya bakuuta ati Maliya? Bawabo bushe nabo tali ni Yakobo, Yosefu, Simoni na Yuda? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />Ne nkashi shakwe bushe teisho twaba nasho kuno? Nga nipi afumya fyonse fi?” <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Kyalibakoseele pa kumuteketela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:57">Yesu epakubeba ati, “Kasesema kumbi alakindikwa, kano fye ku ba mu musumba mwakwe na ba mung'anda mwakwe.” <verse eid="MAT 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />Ekyo tapangileko ifisungusho ifyakufula pantu taba muteketele.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s">Imfwa yakwa Yowane kabatisha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mako6.14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luka9.7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Pali ilya nshita, Helodi imfumu ya Galile yalyumfwile palwa kwa Yesu, <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />epakweba bafilolo baiko ati, “Uyu ni Yowane kabatisha e washikukile ku bakufwa ekyo akokitila ifisungusho fya maka.”<verse eid="MAT 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />Pantu Helodi wine alikete Yowane no kumupoosa mu kifungo pa mulandu wakwa Helodia, muka wabo, Filipo. <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" />Pantu Yowane kabatisha ali kweba Helodi ati, “Takya suminishiwa webo ukuupa Helodia!” <verse eid="MAT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Helodi naye palikyo ali kufwailisha apakumwipaila, nomba ali kutiina Abayuda pantu balimwishibile Yowane ati ni kasesema.<verse eid="MAT 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Ulo bwafikile ubushiku bwa kusefya ukufyalwa kwakwa Helodi, kwalishilepo mwana mwanakashi wakwa Helodia mukukinda pa kampalabwa, naye Helodi ali sansamukile <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />no kumulaya ati, “Nkolapa ukwebati ndi no kukupeela kyonse ungalomba kuli nebo!”<verse eid="MAT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Umwana mwanakashi naye pa kutunkwa kuli nyina alyebele ati, “Ndeteleni pano peka umutwi wakwa Yowane kabatisha pa nsani.”<verse eid="MAT 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Imfumu yalisakamikilwe lelo pa mulandu wa mulapo ya pangile pa kinso kya beni epakweba fye ati ubufwayo bwa mwana nga bukitwe. <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />Ekyo batempwileko umutwi wakwa Yowane ulo ali mu kifungo. <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />Umutwi wakwe bauletele pa nsani no kupeela kisotwe elo naye epakupeela kuli nyina. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Abasambi bakwa Yowane epakwisa kusendapo umubili wakwe ukuya kushiika, elo baya kweba Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu apeela imikate ku bantu abali amakana yasano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mako6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka9.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yowane6.1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Yesu pa kumfweli lyashi, alipateme mu bwange no kuya kuba eka. Abantu pa kumfwe fyo bafumine mu misumba yabo no ku mukonkelela ukwenda fye panshi. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Yesu pa kupatuka mu bwange, epakubona bantu abakuti ubwingi, ali balangulukile mu mutima wakwe no kuposha bonse abalwele.<verse eid="MAT 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Pali kilya kyungulo, abasambi baishile kuli Yesu ati, “Ubushiku bwalaila elo muno tuli ni mu kiswebebe. Lekeni aba bantu baye kushitako ifyakulya mu mishi.”<verse eid="MAT 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Yesu alibasukile ati, “Aba bantu tabalingilile kuya, mwebo bene bapenipo ifyakulya.”<verse eid="MAT 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Elo balimwasukile ati, “Tukwetepo fye imikate isano ne sabi libili.”<verse eid="MAT 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Naye epakubeba ati, “Leteni kuno.” <verse eid="MAT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />Epakweba ibumba ukwikalako pa kyani. Abulile imikate isano ne sabi libili, apunamina mwiulu, atashishe no kupaala, elo apesaula no kupeela ku basambi bakwe, elo nabo bayabanya ku bantu. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Bonse panuma ya kulya bali kutile no kutolelela utupandwa nato ali pangilemo imiseke ikumi limo na ibili iyakwisula. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Abalileko bali nalimo amakana yasano (5,000) ukwakubula ukupendelako abanakashi na baike.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aenda pali bemba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mako6.45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yowane6.15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Pekapo Yesu akinkishe abasambi ukupatama mu bwange, ukumutangilila bushilya bwa bemba no kuleka amabumba ya bantu ati balekuya. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Panuma abantu baya, alile ku lupili mu kupepa eka, eko ali mpaka bwaila. <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />Ubwange bwaliko apatali no mulundu bukopungaila ku maaba, bukosenswa pantu umwela wali kubakilinganya.<verse eid="MAT 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />Pamakyakya Yesu alile ukwali abasambi, akoenda pali Bemba. <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />Abasambi pa kumubona akoenda pali bemba, balyumfwile umwenso, no kulandati, “Ikibanda,” epakupunda ku mwenso.<verse eid="MAT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Yesu epakubeba pekapo ati, “Mwiba na mwenso, ni nebo.”<verse eid="MAT 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Petelo epakweba Yesu ati, “Nga ni webo Shikulu, ngeba nandibo ngise nkoenda pa menshi.”<verse eid="MAT 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />Yesu alimwasukile ati, “Isa!” Petelo epakupatuka mu bwange, alitampile no kwenda pa menshi ukulungama ukwali Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Nomba ulo abwene umwela wakosa, alyumfwile umwenso, alitampile ukwibila. Epakupunda ati, “Shikulu ngafweniko!”<verse eid="MAT 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Kangu kangu fye, Yesu epakumwikata pa kuboko no kumweba ati, “Nindo watwishikila, wewa kiteketelo kinini?”<verse eid="MAT 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />Ulo bapateme mu bwange, elo no mwela watalele tondolo. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Na basambi bonse abali mu bwange balitampile ukushinshimuna Yesu ati, “Kyakine ni webo Mwana Lesa.”<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aposha abalwele mu Genesaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Mako6.53-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Pa kwabukila bushilya bwa Bemba ba fikile mu kyalo kya Genesaleti. <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />Ulo abantu ba kuli ilya nkende ba mwishibile, epa ku kuuta abalwele abali mu mishi ya palamineko no kubaleta kuli Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />Bali mupapatile ati abali kulwala bakumyeko fye ku kisempe kya nsalu yakwe, na bonse abakumisheko bali polele.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s">Intambi shafikolwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Mako7.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Ulo Abafalise na Bakafundisha bamafunde bambi bafumine ku Yelusalemu ne kipusho kya kwebati, <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />“Nindo abasambi bobe batakonkela ntambi shafikolwe fyesu? Pantu tabasamba ku mimwe pa kulya nge fyo kilingilile ukuba.”<verse eid="MAT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Yesu naye alibasukile ati, “Nindo na mwebo mupepwila ikipope kyakwa Lesa pa mulandu fye wa ntambi shenu? <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Apo ni Lesa umwine ewaebele ati, ‘Ulekukindika wiso na noko kabili uwatipa wishi nangula nyina alingilile ukwipaiwa.’ <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />Nomba mwebo mufunda bantu ati, uyo onse weba wishi nangula nyina ati pa fintu ningilile ukumipeelapo pa kumyafwako, ‘ni mfipeela kuli Lesa,’ ninshi takonkele ikyebo kyakwafwa wishi nangula nyina. <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />Tabali na kukindika ba wishibo na ba nyinabo. Ekyo tamukonka ifunde lyakwa Lesa pantu mwalilemyapo intambi shenu. <verse eid="MAT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Mwe babumbimunda mwe! Kasesema Isaya ali lungikile ulo aseseme palwa mwebo ati:<verse eid="MAT 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />“Aba bantu bankindika fye pa tunwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:8">nomba imitima yabo yali taluka kuli nebo.<verse eid="MAT 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />Banshinshimuna apafye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:9">na mafunde yabo ya buntunse.”<verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ifikowesha umuntu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Mako7.14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Ulo Yesu akuutile ibumba lya bantu alibebele ati, “Kutikeni no kwiluka. <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />Ifingila mu kanwa ka muntu teti fimulenge ukukowela, kano ifyakufumamo.”<verse eid="MAT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Elo abasambi balishile kuli Yesu no kumweba ati, “Bushe tamwishibile ati Abafalise balifulilwe pakumfwa ifyo mwakisosa?”<verse eid="MAT 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />Yesu epakubasuka ati, “Tata wa mwiulu akatupula ikimuti kyonse ikyo talimbikile. <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" />Ikyo ki misakamika! Aba ni ba ntungulushi mpofu, elo impofu nga yatungulula impofu inakwe, bonse kuti baya kuponena mu kilindi.”<verse eid="MAT 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Petelo alilandile ati, “Tulondolweleni pali uyu mulumbe mwalanda.”<verse eid="MAT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Yesu alibasukile ati, “Bushe na mwebo tamulati kwiluka? <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />Tamwishibile ati, kyonse ikingila mu kanwa kipulila mu mala elo kyafuma mu mubili. <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Nomba ififuma mu kanwa fifuma mu mutima efilenga ukukowela. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />Pantu ni mu mutima emufuma amotontonkanyo yabubi, ukwipaya, ubukende, ubulalelale ubun'go, ubufi no kulandila bambi ifyabubi. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Ifi fyonse filenga umuntu uku kowela. Nomba ukulya ukwakubulo kusamba ku minwe tekuti kulenge umuntu ukukowela.”<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikiteketelo kya mwanakashi umwina Kenani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Mako7.24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Elo Yesu pakufuma apo, epakuya mu kyalo kya Turi na Sidoni. <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Umwanakashi umwina kenani umwikashi wa muli ilya nkende alishile kuli Yesu, akopunda ati, “We Shikulu mwana Davidi, unangulukileko! Umwana wangi kisotwe alikwete kibanda kabili kilamukyusha bubi bubi.”<verse eid="MAT 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Nomba Yesu talandilepo kintu. Elo abasambi balimupapatile ati, “Mutamfyeni pantu akotupanga fye ikyongo pa kutukonka!”<verse eid="MAT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Naye Yesu alyasukile ati, “Nalituminwe fye kubena Islaeli, imbelele shakuluba.”<verse eid="MAT 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Nomba ulya mwanakashi, epakwisa kufukama pa nkasa shakwa Yesu no kumwebati, “We Shikulu ungafweko!” <verse eid="MAT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Yesu naye alimwasukile ati, “Takilingile ukusenda ikyakulya kya bana no ku kipoosa ku mbwa.” Umwanakashi naye alimwasukile ati,<verse eid="MAT 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />“Efyeke fyo mukwai, nomba ne mbwa nasho shilatolelela amapande ya kopona kwi tebulo lyakwa shikulubo.” <verse eid="MAT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Yesu alimwasukile ati, “We mwanakashi webo, ikiteketelo kyobe kilikulile! Ekyo ukopokelela ikyo ukofwaya.” Pekapo, umwana wakwe alipolele.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aposha abengi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Yesu pa kufuma alile mu mukulo wa Bemba wa Galile. Aninine pa mbali ya lupili no kuya kwikalapo. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Abantu abakuti ubwingi balishilepo ukuleta abakulemana amolu, impofu, abali kusunkuta, bakibulu, na bengi abali kulwala, epakubapalamika pa makasa yakwa Yesu naye alibaposeshe bonse. <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />Abantu kyalibapapwishe pa ku bona bakibuulu bakolanda, abali kusunkuta bakoenda fye bwino, abakulemana bakoenda elo na bampofu bakobona, epakulumbanya Lesa wakwa Islaeli.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aliisha abantu amakana yane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Mako8.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Yesu akuutile abasambi bakwe no kubebati, “Nkolangulukilako aba bantu apo twaliba nabo kuno pa nshiku shitatu ukwakubula ifyakulya. Pantu nga mbaleke baye kwabo, bakofwa ulushile munshila.”<verse eid="MAT 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Abasambi epakwipusha Yesu ati, “Muno tuli ni mukiswebebe, nganipi tungaya kufisanga ifyakulya fyakulisha ibumba lya ku kulefi?”<verse eid="MAT 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Yesu alibepwishe ati, “Ngale mikate inga mukwetepo?” Nabo epakumwasuka ati, “Tulipo fye ne mikate kine lubali no tusabi tubili.”<verse eid="MAT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Yesu naye aebele bumba lya bantu ukwikalako panshi. <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />Kabili alibulile ne mikate kine lubali ne sabi no kutasha Lesa, ukuipesaula, no kuipeela ku basambi bakwe, nabo epakwabanyako abantu. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Bonse abalile bali kutile fyashala napo. Elo abasambi balisendelepo imiseke kine lubali iya tumokolwa twashelepo. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Impendwa ya baume balileko bali amakana yane ukwakubula ukupendelako abanakashi na baike.<verse eid="MAT 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Panuma apalanganya ibumba lya bantu, Yesu alipateme mu bwange no kuya mu nkende ya Magadani.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s">Abafalise bafwaya ikishibilo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Mako8.11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luka12.54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />Abafalise na Basaduke bambi baishile kuli Yesu mu kumwesha. Balimwebele ati akitepo ikishibilo kimo ikyakufuma kwiulu. <verse eid="MAT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Nomba Yesu alibasukile ati, “Ulo akasuba kali mukuwa, mulebati ‘Umwela ukoba bwino apo iulu lilikashikile.’ <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />Na pa makya mulasosa ati, ‘Imfula ikoloka apo kyafutika ne ulu lyakashika no kutiinya.’ Mulishibile ukwilula pa fyo iulu likoboneka, nomba tamwilula no kwishiba shino nshita. <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />Abantu bankulo ino babubi kabili tabeshibile Lesa. Bakofwaya ikishibilo nomba tabaka kibone kano fye kishibilo kyakwa Yona.” Epakubasha aya.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikitutumushi kya Bafalise na Basaduke</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Mako8.14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />Ulo bayabukile bushilya bwa bemba, balilabile ukusendapo mukate. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />Elo Yesu alibebele ati, “Mule kukengela no kuibaka ku kitutumushi kya Bafalise na Basaduke.”<verse eid="MAT 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Elo balitampile ukwambaula ati, “Ikyo alandile fi nikyo tatulipo ne mikate?”<verse eid="MAT 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Yesu alishibile ifyo bali kulanda naye epakubepusha ati, “Nindo muko ambaula ati tamukwetepo imikate? Mwe ba kiteketelo kinini! <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Bushe tamulati kwiluka. Tamwibwishe ulo na pesawile imikate isano pa bantu amakana yasano? Miseke inga mwaiswishe? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />Kabili na pa mikate kine lubali pa bantu amakana yane napo miseke inga mwaiswishe? <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />Mwafilwa shani ukwiluka ati nebo ntakolanda palwa mikate? Kengeleni fye ku kitutumushi kya Bafalise na Basaduke.”<verse eid="MAT 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Elo abasambi bailukile ati takolanda pa kitutumushi ikibomfeshiwa mu mikate. Akolanda pa masambilisho ya Bafalise na Basaduke.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petelo ashimbula ati Yesu ni Klistu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Mako8.27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luka9.18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Yesu pa kufika mu nkende umwabela umusumba wa Kasalia Filipi, eko aipwishe abasambi bakwe ati, “Bushe abantu bebati Umwana wa muntu ni nani?”<verse eid="MAT 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />Elo bamwasukile ati, “Bambi balebati ni Yowane kabatisha. Bambi nabo balebati ni Eliya elo bambi nabo balebati ni Yelemia na bambi balebati ni umo wa muli bakasesema.”<verse eid="MAT 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Naye Yesu epakubepusha ati, “Nga mwebo mwebati ni nebo nani?”<verse eid="MAT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />Elo Simoni Petelo alimwasukile ati, “Ni webo Klistu, Umwana wakwa Lesa wa mweo.”<verse eid="MAT 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Yesu alimwasukile ati, “Ulishukile Simoni mwana Yona! Apo iki kishinka tekyakufuma ku buntunse, kyakufuma fye kuli Tata wa mwiulu. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />Ekyo na kwebati, ni webo Petelo, kabili pa kilibwe ki epo nkakulila ulukuta lwangi, na maka yamfwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(amaka yamfwa,) mu kigiliki baleta ati Hades</char></note> tayali na kulwansha. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />Nkakupeela ne mfungulo sha Bufumu bwa mwiulu, pakwebati kyonse ukabinda pesonde, kikesa kubindwa mwiulu, nekyo ukasuminisha pesonde ninshi na kwiulu kika suminishiwa.”<verse eid="MAT 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Elo Yesu alyebekeshe abasambi bakwe ati be ebako muntu nangu umo ati e Klistu.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asobela amakyushi ne mfwa yakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:31-9:1">Mako8.31—9.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luka9.22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Ukufumapo, Yesu alitampile ukulanda ku basambi bakwe pabwelu ati, “Nkoya ku kyula mu Yelusalemu kuli bakilolo, banshimapepo bakindami na bakafundisha bamafunde. Ndi no kwipaiwa nomba ulo pakapitapo inshiku shitatu, nkesa kushikuka.”<verse eid="MAT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />Petelo alisendele Yesu pa mbali atampa ukumukalipila ati, “Tefyo Shikulu, teti kibe fyo!” <verse eid="MAT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Yesu epa kupilibukila kuli Petelo no kumweba ati, “Fumapa Satana! Ulikipunwisho munshila yangi, apo amatontonkanyo yobe teyakufuma kuli Lesa, ya buntunse fye.”<verse eid="MAT 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Yesu alyebele abasambi bakwe ati, “Onse uukofwaya ukunkonka naikanye, asende no lupanda lwakwe elo ankonke. <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />Pantu onse uufwaya ukupususha umweo wakwe akaulofya, nomba uwalufya umweo wakwe pali nebo akaunonka. <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />Bushe umuntu kuti kyamwafwa indo umfwa anonka ifya pesonde fyonse, elo nomba alofya umweo wakwe? Nangula pengabapo kintu angapeela pa kukabushamo mweo wakwe? <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Umwana wa Muntu ali pepi pepi no kwisa mu bukindami bwakwa wishi na bamalaika bakwe mukulambula onse ukulingana nefyo abombele. <verse eid="MAT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />Nkomyeba ikyakine, bambi pali mwebo tabali na kufwa mpaka bakabone Umwana wa Muntu akoisa mu Bufumu bwakwe.”<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ayaluka mu mibonekele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Mako9.2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luka9.28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />Ulo papitilepo inshiku mutanda, Yesu alisendele Petelo na wabo wakwa Yakobo, uyo ni Yowane epakubatungulula pa lupili ulwakulepa uko baile kuba fye beka. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Elo babwene Yesu ayalukile, pa kinso ali kubengeshima kubati kasuba, ne nsalu afwele shalitubile sana. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Pekapo balibwene Mose na Eliya bakoambaula na Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Petelo alyebele Yesu ati, “Shikulu kingatuwamina ukuba pano. Nga mukofwaya kuti napangapo insakwe shitatu, imbi wenu, imbi yakwa Mose, elo na imbi yakwa Eliya.”<verse eid="MAT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />Ulo ali kulande fyo, ikumbi ilyakubengeshima lyaisa kubakupilisha, mwafumine ne shiwi lyakwebati, “Uyu e Mwana wangi natemwisha, mukutikeni!”<verse eid="MAT 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />Abasambi pa kumfwa ilyo ishiwi, balyumfwile umwenso no kuipoosa panshi bunkupeme. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Elo Yesu pa kufikapo bali alibebele ati, “Alamukeni, mwiba na mwenso.” <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Ulo ba punamine mwiulu, tababwenepo nangu umo kano fye Yesu eka.<verse eid="MAT 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Pa kutentemuka ulupili, Yesu alibebekeshe ati, “Mwikebako muntu nangu umo mpaka Umwana wa Muntu akashikuke ku bakufwa.”<verse eid="MAT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Elo abasambi baipwishe Yesu ati, “Nindo Bakafundisha bamafunde bebelati Eliya eukatampilapo ukwisa?”<verse eid="MAT 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Yesu alimwasukile ati, “Mukine fye Eliya eukambilapo kwisa. kabili akesa kupekanya fyonse. <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />Nomba nkomyebati Eliya alisa kale, na bantu tabamwishibile, bamukitile umo bali kufwaila. Efyo bakakyusha no Mwana wa Muntu.”<verse eid="MAT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Abasambi epakwiluka ati akolanda pali Yowane Kabatisha.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aposha umulumendo uwali ne kibanda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Mako9.14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luka9.37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Pa kubwekela ukwali bumba lya bantu, umuntu umo alishile kufukamina Yesu, <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />ati, “Shikulu kwatenipo luse pa mwana wangi umulumendo. Alikwata kipumputu kabili alatunya, pambi alaponena mu mulilo nangula mu menshi. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />Nakimuleta ku basambi benu nomba ta bamuposeshe.”<verse eid="MAT 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />Yesu alyasukile ati, “Mwe bantu bakubulwa ikiteketelo kabili mwe bakalufyanya mwe! Ni panshita ndo nkaba na mwebo? Nkashipikisha na mwebo ukushinta pi? Leteni umulumendo kuno!” <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Yesu epakukalipila ikibanda nakyo kyalifuminemo mu mulumendo, pekapo alipolele.<verse eid="MAT 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Elo abasambi balishile kuli Yesu kumbali ati, “Nindo fwebo tufililwe ukutamfya ikibanda?”<verse eid="MAT 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" />Yesu alibasukile ati, “Nikyo ikiteketelo kyenu kya kukeepa, nkomyeba nga mwalikwetepo ikiteketelo kubati luseke lwa lubanga, kuti mwalanda kuli ulu lupili ati, ‘Fuma pano, kabuye palya.’ Nalo kuti lwaya. Kuti mwakita ikili kyose. <verse eid="MAT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21" />Nomba tamunga tamfya umupashi wakubefi kano fye ku mapepo na mafungo.”<verse eid="MAT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alanda kabili palwa kufwa kwakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mako9.30-32</ref>; Luka9.43b-45)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Ulo abasambi bonse bakolongene mu Galile, Yesu alibebele ati, “Umwana wa Muntu ali no kupooswa mu minwe ya bantu. <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />Baka mwipaya nomba panuma ya nshiku shitatu akesa kuba no mweo.” Abasambi balyumfwile ubulanda.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukulipila kwa musonko we Tempele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />Ulo Yesu na basambi bakwe bafikile ku musumba wa kapenamu, bakasonkesha ba musonko we Tempele balishile kuli Petelo ne kipusho ati, “Bushe kafundisha wenu alalipila umusonko we Tempele?”<verse eid="MAT 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />Petelo naye alyasukile ati, “Alalipila.” Ulo Petelo aingile mung'anda, Yesu ewatampilepo kulanda ati, “Uko tontonkanyapo shani Simoni, ni kuli banani bashamfumu ba pesonde bapoka umusonko ne misangulo? Bushe ni ku bana babo nangula ni kuli bambi?” <verse eid="MAT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />Petelo alyasukile ati, “Ni kuli bambi.” Yesu epakumweba ati, “Kanshi nomba abana tabengalipila. <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />Nomba apo tatukofwaya aba bantu batufulilwe, webo kabuye kuli bemba. Uye kupoosapo indobani pe shiba, elo isabi uleya kuloba pa kwamba, ulikenamune mu kanwa. Ukoya kusangamo indalama iyakulingana no musonko wa mwi Tempele. Ubule no kuya kulipila umusonko wangi no obe wine.”<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s">Umukulupo ni nani?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mako9.33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luka9.46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />Pali ilya nshita, abasambi balishile kuli Yesu ne kipusho ati, “Bushe ni nani umukulupo mu Bufumu bwa mwiulu?”<verse eid="MAT 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />Yesu alikuutile umwaike no kumwimanika pakati kabo. <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />Epakubeba ati, “Nkomweba ikine kine ati, umfwa tamupindulukile no kubati baike, tamwakengilemo mu Bufumu bwa mwiulu. <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Ekyo, onse ukaikefya kubati mwaike, e mukulu mu Bufumu bwa mwiulu. <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />Umuntu onse uwapokelela umwaike ngo yu, mwishina lyangi, ninshi apokelela nebo.<verse eid="MAT 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukulengela bambi ukubembuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Mako9.42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luka17.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />“Nomba uwalengela umo pali utu utwakukepa ukufuma ku kiteketelo muli nebo, kuti kyamuwamina ukukulikwa ikilibwe kya mpelo mu mukoshi, no kupooswa pe shiba lya bemba. <verse eid="MAT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />Akalanda pesonde pa mulandu wa fipunwisho. Fyena fikesa kubapo, nomba takyakawame ku ukalengela abanakwe ukubembuka.<verse eid="MAT 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />“Ekyo ikisansa kyobe nangula ulukasa nga fwakulengela ukubembuka, ufiputuleko, no kufipoosa. kyawamapo ukwingila mu mweo bumakunkutu nangula ikilema, ukukilapo ukukwate fisansa fibili nangula makasa yabili mu mulilo wapee. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Kabili ilinso lyobe nga lyakulengela ukubembuka, ulitonkolemo, kyakulingila ukwingila mu mweo ne linso limo ukukilapo ukwate amenso yabili no kupooswa mu ngehena.<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umulumbe wa mbelele yalubile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luka15.3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10" />“Boneni ati tamusulilepo umo pali aba baike. Nkomyeba mukine ati, bamalaika babo lonse babona ikinso kyakwa Tata mwiulu. <verse eid="MAT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11" />Pantu Mwana wa Muntu aishile mukufwaya no kupususha abakuluba.<verse eid="MAT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />“Ngale mwebo mukotontonkanyapo shani pa muntu umo uwalufishepo imbelele imo pa shali umwanda umo. Bushe tekuti ashe shilya amakumi pabula na pabula mutupili no kuya kufwaya iyalubile? <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />Na pakuisanga, nkomyeba mukine, akasekelela sana pali ilya imo iyalubile ukukishapo napali shilya amakumi pabula na pabula ishashelepo. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />Ekyo tekufwaya kwakwa Tata mwiulu ati palubepo umo pali aba baike.<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">wenu nga kulufyanya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />“Wenu nga kulufyanya, kabuyeko umushinike apo alubile. Ambaushanyeni mweka babili. Nga omfwe ninshi wa muwikisha. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Nomba ngakana ukumfwa, sendapo umo nangu babili pakwebati pa bunte bwa babili nangula batatu, ikyebo kimakane. <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Kabili nako ngafilwa ukumfwa, utwale umulandu ku Lukuta, nako nga tomfwile, ninshi mu mukite fye ngo utaishiba Lesa nangula kasonkesha.<verse eid="MAT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />“Nkomyeba ikine kine ati, kyonse kyo mukakaka pe sonde ninshi na mwiulu kilikakilwe. Nekyo mukakakula pe sonde ninshi na mwiulu kilikakwilwe.<verse eid="MAT 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />“Kabili nkomyebati, babili pesonde nga basuminishanya pali kyonse mungalomba, kikabefyo fine, Tata wa mwiulu akakita. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />Apali babili nangula batatu abakolonganina mwi shina lyangi, ninshi nandibo ndi pakati kabo.”<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umulumbe wa mubomfi uutali kwelela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Elo Petelo alishile kuli Yesu ne kipusho ati, “Shikulu, bushe ni pa miku inga ningelela wesu ulo ambifya? Bushe ni pa miku kine lubali?”<verse eid="MAT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />Yesu alimwasukile ati, “Te pa miku kine lubali,” lelo ni pa miku “amakumi kine lubali imiku kine lubali.” <verse eid="MAT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />Ekyo Ubufumu bwa mwiulu kuti twabupalakanya ku mfumu imo iyali kufwailisha ifyo ababomfi bali kubomfya indalama shaiko. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />Ulo ya tampile ukupitulukamo, balileteleko umo uwalipo ne misha amatalanta amakana ikumi limo. <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Nomba ena pa kubulwa ikyakulipililamo, imfumu yalyebele ati, “Nko kushitisha pamo no mukashi obe, abana bobe na fyonse wakwata ekulipila imisha.” <verse eid="MAT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />Ulya mubomfi alifukeme panshi, no kupapata ku mfumu, ati, “Nkopapata, ntekanishishenipo, nkafwailishe mpaka nkalipile fyonse.” <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />Imfumu ya mulangulukile, ukufuuta ilya misha yonse no kuleka aye.<verse eid="MAT 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />“Nomba ulya mubomfi pa kufumapo, alisangile umubomfi munakwe umo uwa mukwatile fye tundalama twa silfele umwanda umo. Epakumwikata na pa mukoshi, ati, ‘Kano fye umpeele indalama shangi.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />Umunakwe alilombele uluse ati, ‘untekanishishe, nkakufwaile.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />Nomba naye alikene mpaka fye amupoosa mukifungo. <verse eid="MAT 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />Ulo ababomfi banakwe baumfwile fyo balifulilwe sana. Baile ku mfumu ukuyakuyeba fyonse ifyakitikile ku munabo. <verse eid="MAT 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />Elo imfumu ya kuutile ulya mubomfi no kumwebaula ati, ‘We mbifi ya mubomfi we, nebo na likwelela pali fyonse pantu walimpapete. <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />Walingile ukukwatako luse ku munobe nga filya na nebo nakukitile.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />Imfumu yalifulilwe sana, yamwikata no kumupoosa mukifungo no ku mukyusha mpaka fye akalipile indalama shonse.”<verse eid="MAT 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />Mu musango umo wine, “Tata wa mwiulu efyo akakita kuli mwebo nga mwafilwa ukwelela bawenu ukufuma panshi ya mutima.”<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s">Ukulekana mu fyupo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Mako10.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Yesu pa kupwisha ukulanda ayo mashiwi, alifumine mu Galile no kufika ku kyalo kya Yudea bushilya bwa nika ya Yodani. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />Abantu abakuti ubwingi balimukonkele. Naye kulya kwine epakubaposha ku malwele.<verse eid="MAT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Abafalise bambi balishile pa kumwesha ne kipusho ati, “Bushe amafunde yesu yalipeela insambu ku mwalalume ukuleka umukashi pa mulandu uli fye onse?”<verse eid="MAT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Yesu alibasukile ati, “Bushe tamwabelengapo ikyebo kyaebati pakutampa, kabumba alengele umwalalume no mwanakashi? <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />Elo Lesa aebele ati, ‘Nipalikyo umwalalume ashiila wishi na nyina no kulundinkana no mukashi wakwe, nabo babili baba umubili umo.’ <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />Tabalipo babili nomba, bali fye umubili umo. Ikyo Lesa alundinkanya, umuntu nangu umo ekilekanya.”<verse eid="MAT 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />Abafalise nabo epakumwipusha ati, “Nindo Mose atupeelele ifunde lyakwebati, umwalalume ulo afwaya ukuleko mukashi wakwe ali no kulemba kalata wa kumulekelapo no kumutamfya?”<verse eid="MAT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Yesu alibasukile ati, “Ikyo Mose amipeelele insambu shakulekana ni kyo imitima yenu yakutalama. Nomba pa kwamba tefyo kyali. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />Nomba nebo nkomyeba ati, onse uwaleka umukashi wakwe, apakubula umulandu wa bukende, no kuyakupapo umwanakashi umbi, ninshi akita ubukende.”<verse eid="MAT 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Abasambi bakwe balimwebele Yesu ati, “Ifinga efyo kyaba pa mulume no mukashi ninshi kuti kyabapo bwino ku muntu nga topile.”<verse eid="MAT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Yesu alibasukile ati, “Tekuli bonse ilisambilisho lingabomfiwa, kano fye kubo kyapeelwa. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Pantu kwaliba imilandu iya ku pusana pusana iilenga bantu kutoopa. Bambi efyo bafyelwe. Bambi balitungulwa fye ku bantu, elo bambi nabo nipa mulandu wa Bufumu bwa mwiulu. Uwingapokelela ikisambilisho iki, ngakipokelele fye.”<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu apaala abaike</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mako10.13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luka18.15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Abantu bambi baletele abaike kuli Yesu pakwebati atambalikipo amaboko yakwe pa kubapepelako. Nomba abasambi balitampile ukukalipila balya bantu. <verse eid="MAT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />Yesu alibebele ati, “Lekeni abaike bese kuli nebo, mwibalesha pantu ebene ba Bufumu bwa mwiulu bakuba nga baike.”<verse eid="MAT 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Alitambalikilepo amaboko yakwe pa baike, elo no kufumapo.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umulumendo wa kunonka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mako10.17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka18.18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Kuli Yesu kwaishilepo umuntu umo ne kipusho ati, “Kindo ikyabune ningakita pakwebati nkwatepo mweo wa muyayaya?”<verse eid="MAT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />Naye Yesu ati nindo uko ngipushisha pa kyabune? Tapabapo Uwabune nangu umo, kano fye Lesa eka. Ulekukonka fye ifipope elo ukaba no mweo.<verse eid="MAT 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Naulya muntu alimwipwishe ati, “Fipope ndo?” Yesu naye alimwasukile ati,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 19:18">“Wilekwipaya, wilekukita bukende, wilekwiba, wilekubepesha bambi ifya bufi, <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />ulekukindika wiso na noko no kutemwa umunobe nga we mwine.”<verse eid="MAT 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Umulumendo alimwasukile ati, “Ifyo fyonse nebo ndafikonka, bushe palipo fimbi ni ngakita?”<verse eid="MAT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Yesu alimwebele ati, “Nga ukofwaya ukubapo uwakupwililika, ngale kabuye ushitishe ifyuma fyobe fyonse, upeele ne indalama ku balanda, lwena uka kwata ifyuma mwiulu. Elo nomba wise kunkonka.”<verse eid="MAT 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Pa kumfwefyo, umulumendo afuminepo uwa bulanda ikyo alikwatishe fyuma.<verse eid="MAT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Yesu aebele abasambi bakwe ati, “Nkomyebe kine kine ati, kyakwafya kuwa fyuma pa kwingila mu Bufumu bwa mwiulu. <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />Nkobwekeshapo na kambi ati, kyakwangukapo ingamali ukupita mulinso lya nshindano ukukila umukankala ukwingila mu Bufumu bwakwa Lesa.”<verse eid="MAT 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Abasambi pa kumfwa ifyo, kyalibapapwishe sana epakwipusha ati, “Nga ni nani angapusuka?”<verse eid="MAT 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Yesu naye pakubalolesha ali basukile ati, “Ku bantu kintu kya yafya, nomba kuli Lesa fyonse kuti fyakitwa.”<verse eid="MAT 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Petelo naye epakwipusha ati, “Nga fwebo tukasangamo indo, apo twalisha fyonse no kule kumikonka?”<verse eid="MAT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />Yesu alimwasukile ati, Nkomyeba mukine ati, mu kyalo kipya ulo Mwana wa Muntu akesa kwikala pa kipuma mu bukindami bwakwe, na mwebo mukesa kwikala pa fipuna ikumi limo na fibili ukulekuteeka no kupingule milandu ya mikowa ikumi limo na ibili iya Islaeli. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Uyo onse uwasha mayanda, bawabo, inkashi, wishi nangula nyina, abana na mabala pa mulandu wangi, akapeelwa imiku umwanda umo no mweo wa muyayaya peka. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Nomba bengi abatangile bakesa kuba abakulekelela, na bengi abalekelele bakesa kutangila.<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s">Ababomfi ba mwibala lya mwangashi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />“Ubufumu bwa mwiulu kuti twa bupalakanya ku muntu umo awaile pa makya mu kufwayapo abakumubombele milimo ya mwibala lya mwangashi. <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />Balilanshenye ukubalipila amalipilo ya kasuba kamo. Epakubatuma kyakwe kwibala. <verse eid="MAT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />Kabili aile ku kisankano panshita ya 09:00 koloko, alifumine, epakusanga bambi balimakene pa lubansa lwa kisankano apakubulwapo ikyo bakokita. <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />Nabo alibebele ati, ‘Na mwebo kabombeniko mwibala lya mwangashi, nkomipeela amalipilo aya kulinga.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Efyo baile. Kabili pa nshita ya 12:00 koloko na pa nshita ya 15:00 koloko napo akitile kimo kine. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />Nomba pepi fye ne nshita ya 17:00 koloko elo abwekelemo ku kisankano ukuya kusangako bambi balimakene. Alibepwishe ati, ‘Nindo mwimakanine pano akasuba konse?’ <verse eid="MAT 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />Nabo balimwasukile ati, ‘Tapalipo uwa kwisa ku tubomfyapo umulimo.’ Epakubeba nabo ukuya kubomba mwibala lyakwe ilya mwangashi.<verse eid="MAT 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />“Pa kyungulo umwine we bala aebele kangalila wa bankito uku kuuta ababomfi bonse pa ku bapeela amalipilo yabo. Atampiile pa balekeleleko, ukushinta na pa batampiilepo. <verse eid="MAT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />Abatampile nkito pa nshita ya 17:00 koloko bapokele amalipilo yamoyene kila muntu aya kasuba kamo. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Nomba ulo balya batampiilepo baishile mu kupoka amalipilo yabo, bali kutontonkanya ati, bena bakopoka amalipilo ayengi, nomba nabo balipeelwe fye yamoyene na banabo. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />Epakusenda indalama shabo pa kuilishanya ku mwine we bala, <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />ati, ‘Abalekelele ukutampa inkito, nindo bapokela amalipilo yamoyene na fwebo?’ <verse eid="MAT 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />Naye alibasukile ati, ‘Kutikeni mwefibusa fyangi, ntamifyengele nebo. Bushe tamwakisumina ukupoka amalipilo ya kasuba kamo? <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />Kabuyeni fye pantu nkofwaya mpeeleko uwakulekelela amalipilo yamoyene nga mwebo. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />Ndikwetepo insambu shakukita ikyo nkofwaya ne ndalama shangi na pamo ulifye na kalumwa pantu ndi wa kupeela sana?’”<verse eid="MAT 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />“Ekyo abali ku ntanshi bakaba pa kulekelesha, na bali pakulekelesha bakesa kuba pa ntanshi.”<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alanda pa kufwa kwakwe pa muku wa kitatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mako10.32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luka18.31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Yesu ulo ali pa lwendo lwa kuninika ukuya ku Yelusalemu, alisendele pambali abasambi bakwe ikumi limo na babili beka. <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />Alitampile no kubebati, “Kutikeni kuli nebo, tukoya ku Yelusalemu, uko Umwana wa Muntu akabikwa mu minwe ya banshimapepo bakindami na bakafundisha ba mafunde. Ali no kwipaiwa. <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />Akapooswa mu minwe ya Benafyalo, bakamupunika, ukumupumaula, no kumutanika. Nomba pa bushiku bwa kulenga shitatu akabushiwa ku bakufwa.”<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyina alombelako abana bakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Mako10.35-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Elo nyina lya bamwana Sebede aliletele abana bakwe kuli Yesu, afukama no kulombako kimo.<verse eid="MAT 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />Yesu epakumwipushati, “Nindo ukofwaya nkukitile?” Naye alimwasukile ati, “Nkofwayati pali aba bana bangi babili, umo akekale kukwa mulyo na umbi ku kipiko kobe ulo kesa kuteeka nge Mfumu.”<verse eid="MAT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Yesu alibasukile ati, “Tamwishibilepo ikyo mukolomba. Munganwinapo mulukombo lwa makyushi ndi no kunwinamo?” Nabo balimwasukile ati, “E mukwai kuti twakita.”<verse eid="MAT 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Yesu alibasukile ati, “Efyo, ukunwina mulukombo lwangi kwena kuti mwakita, nomba fye ukwikala ku mulyo kwangi nangula ku kipiko kwangi tenebo ukusala pantu ifi fifulo fyalibanabo fyateyanishiwilwe kuli Tata.”<verse eid="MAT 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Ulo abasambi bambi ikumi limo baumfwile fyo, balifulilwe abana nkashi balya babili. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Elo Yesu alibakolonganikile bonse no kulekubebati, “Mwebo mulishibile ati, bakateeka ba Benafyalo balemya ulupaka na bakulu babo bateeka no mutitikisha. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />Nomba tefyo pali mwebo. Uukofwaya abe umukulu, abe musha wa bonse. <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />No ukofwaya ukuba uwakuntanshi, nabe e musha wenu bonse. <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />Efyo no Mwana wa Muntu naye taishile mu kupyungilwa, kano mukupyungila no kupeela umweo wakwe pa bantu abakuti ubwingi.”<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aposha impofu shibili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mako10.46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka18.35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Yesu ulo ali kufuma mu Yeliko, abantu abakuti ubwingi balimukonkele. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Impofu shibili ishaikele mu mbali ya musebo shalyumfwile ati Yesu akopita, epakwamba ukupunda ati, “Yesu we Shikulu mwana Davidi utubeleleko uluse!”<verse eid="MAT 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Ibumba lya bantu lya tampile ukule kubakalipila no kubebati babe fye kelele. Nomba nabo epakukishapo ukupundati, “Shikulu mwana Davidi utubeleleko uluse!”<verse eid="MAT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />Yesu alimakene, abakuuta no kubepushati, “Nindo mukofwaya mikitile?”<verse eid="MAT 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />Nabo balimwasukile ati, “Tukofwaya ukubona.”<verse eid="MAT 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Yesu pakubakwatile nkumbu, alibekete mu menso yabo, pekapo na menso yalitampile ukubona, nabo epakumukonka.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s">Yesu aingila mu Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mako10.46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka18.35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Ulo Yesu na basambi bakwe ba palamine mu Yelusalemu, bafikile pa nkende ya Betifage ku lupili lwa miolife. Apo Yesu atumineko abasambi babili. <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />Alibebele ati, “Kabuyeni mu mushi uli kuntanshi, pa kwingila fye mukosanga impunda ilikulikilwe pamo na kamwana kakwe, mukakule no kundetela. <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Nga kwabapo uwa kumipusha mwebeni ati, ‘Ni Shikulu eukofifwaya,’ pekapo bakomipeela.”<verse eid="MAT 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Ifi fyonse fyakitikile pa kufikilisha ifyo kasesema alandile,<verse eid="MAT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />“Ebako umwana mwanakashi Sioni ati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">bona Imfumu yobe ikoisa kuli webo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">iya kuikefya, ilininine pa mpunda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">na pa musepela wa mpunda.”<verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Abasambi baile kukita ifyo Yesu abebele. <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />Baliletele impunda na kana, epakwanshikapo insalu shabo elo Yesu aikalanapo. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Abantu abakuti ubwingi balyanshikile nsalu shabo mu musebo. Elo bambi bakontwele mitano ya fimuti no kwanshika mu musebo. <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />Ibumba lyali kuntanshi na kunuma balitampile ukupunda ati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">“Hosana kuli mwana Davidi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:9">Apaalwe uukoishila mwi shina lyakwa Shikulu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:9">Lesa alumbanishiwe!”<verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Ulo Yesu aingile mu Yelusalemu, umusumba onse walikabile ku kyongo. Abantu balikwipusha ati, “Ninani uyo?”<verse eid="MAT 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Abantu bali kukonka Yesu balyasukile ati, Ni kasesema Yesu waku Nasaleti.<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atamfyamo aba makwebo mwi Tempele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mako10.46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka18.35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Yesu alingile mulubansa lwe Tempele no kutamfyamo bonse abali kushita no kushitishamo. Alipenawile amatebulo ya bali kukabushanya indalama ne fipuna fya bali kushitisha inkunda. <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />Alibebele ati, “Kyalilembwa mu malembo ati, ‘ing'anda yangi bakaita ati, ing'anda ya mapepo.’ Nomba mwebo mwaipanga ikifulo kya bang'o.”<verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Impofu na bakulemana amolu balishile mulubansa lwe Tempele naye alibaposeshe. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />banshimapepo bakindami na Bakafundisha ba mafunde pa kubone fyabune ifyo ali kukita na baike mwi Tempele bako pundati, “Alumbwe mwana Davidi!” <verse eid="MAT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />Elo baipwishe Yesu ati, “Bushe mukoumfwa kufyo abaike bakolanda?” Yesu naye alibasukile ati,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:16">“Nkoumfwa. Bushe ta mwabelengapo pali ili lembo? ‘Pa tunwa twa baike na bana abonka epo wa bika malumbo ya kupwililika?’”<verse eid="MAT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Elo Yesu alibashiile no kuya ku Betani uko aile kulaala.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atipa ikimuti kya mukunyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Mako11.12-14</ref>; 20-24)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Ulo Yesu ali pa lwendo lwa ku bwekelamo ku musumba pa makya, ulukelo lwa konkelepo, alyumfwile nsala. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />Epakubona ikimuti kya mukunyu pa mbali ya musebo, ulo afikileko asangileko fye amabula yeka ukwakubula ifisabo. Aebele kimuti ati, “Kwikakatala akutwalapo ikisabo libili kuli webo.” Pekapo ne kimuti kyalala.<verse eid="MAT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Abasambi pa kubone fyo kyalibapapwishe ati, “Alale, alale nindo yu mukunyu wa lalila kangu kangu?”<verse eid="MAT 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />Yesu alibasukile ati, “Nkomyeba ikine kine nga muliteketele apakubula ukutwishika, kuti mwakita ifyo na kitile kuli uyu mukunyu, kabili kuti mwaeba no lupili ati, fumapa, kabuye uipoose muli bemba, kikesa kuba fyeke fyo. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Nga muli ne kiteketelo, mukapokelela kyonse ikyo mukopepelapo.”<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amaka yakwa Yesu uko yafuma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mako11.27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luka20.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Ulo Yesu abwekele mulubansa lwe Tempele, akofunda bantu, banshimapepo bakindami na Bafilolo baishile kumwipushati, “Ninsambu ndo wakwata pa kukite fi fyonse? Kabili ni nani wakupeela ya maka?”<verse eid="MAT 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Yesu naye alibasukile ati, “Nandibo nkomipushapo ngale, nga mwangasuka, elo nandi nkomyasuka? <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />Bushe Yowane afumishepi amaka ya kubatisha? Ni kuli Lesa nangula ni ku bantunse?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:25">Balitampile ukulekuipusha abene, “Tukomwasuka shani? Ngatumwebe ati ya kufuma ‘kuli Lesa,’ naye akotwipusha ati, ‘Nindo muta muteketele?’ <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Pambi nakyo nga tumwebe ati, ‘Ni ku bantu,’ tukoiletelela ku bantu pantu balishibile ati Yowane ni kasesema.” <verse eid="MAT 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Nomba epakwasuka Yesu ati, “Tatwishibilepo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:27">Yesu naye alibasukile ati, “Nandibo ntamyebe ukwafuma ya maka nkitilamo ifi fintu.”<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umulumbe wa bana balalume babili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />“Nomba mukobonapo shani? palipo umuntu umo uwakwete abalalume babili. Aebele umukulubantu ati, ‘We mwana wangi, koye ubombe mwibala lya myangashi lelo.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />Naye alimwasukile ati, ‘Ntayeko.’ Panshita imbi, abweseshe itontonkanyo no kuya kubomba. <verse eid="MAT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />Kabili uyu muntu aile kweba umwana wakwe umbi ukuya kubomba umulimo umowine. Alyasukile ati, ‘Emukwai nkoya kubomba.’ Nomba taile kubomba. <verse eid="MAT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />Bushe ni nani pali balya bana babili akitile ukufyaya kwakwa wishi?” Bali mwasukile ati, “Mukulubantu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Yesu alibebele ati, “Nkomyeba, bakasonkesha na bakilende balekumitangilila mu Bufumu bwa mwiulu. <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />Pantu Yowane kabatisha aishile kumilangilila inshila ya bololoke, ta mwa muketekele, nomba bakasonkesha na bakilende bena bali muteketele. Nangula mwalibwene fyo, tamwalapile no ku muteketela.”<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umulumbe wa balimi bali kusonkela ibala lya mwangashi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mako12.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luka20.9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />Yesu alibebele ati, “Kutikeniko mulumbe na umbi, Kwalipo umuntu umo uwalimine ibala lya myangashi, apindileko no lupango, aimbilemo ne kya kufininamo umwangashi, akulilepo no lupungu lwa bamalonda. Ulo aile pa lwendo, epakusha ibala ku bakusonkela. <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />Panshita ya busomboshi, alitumineko ababomfi bakwe ukuya kusendako ifisabo fimo. <verse eid="MAT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />Bakasunga we bala baimiine abasha, ba puminepo umo, umbi baipaya naumbi balimutobele amabwe. <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Kabili alitumineko ababomfi na bambi abakufulapo ukukila pa bantanshi. Nabo balibakitile kimo kine nga ba pa kutampa. <verse eid="MAT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />Kuli pelwepelwe atumineko umwalalume wakwe umo, alyebele ati, ‘Mukine fye bakaya kumukindika.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />Bakasunga we bala pa kubona ulya mwana mwalalume, baitepelesha ati, ‘Natwipaye iyi ine mpyani yakwe epakwebati ibala litushalile.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Epakumwikata, bamupoosa kunse ye bala no kumwipaya.”<verse eid="MAT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />Yesu alibepwishe ati, “Bushe ulo umwine we bala akesa, akesa kita shani kuli balya bakasunga?”<verse eid="MAT 21:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />Nabo balimwasukile ati, “Akesa kubepaya bakintomfwabo no kwisa kusekesha ibala lya mwangashi kuli bambi abakesa kumupeelako ifisabo panshita yakusombola.”<verse eid="MAT 21:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />Yesu epakubebati, “Bushe tamwabelengapo ikyalembwa mu malembo ikilanda ati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">“Ilibwe bakakuula basulile</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">e lyaisa kuba ilikankala.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">Iki kyakitilwe fye na Shikulu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">kabili kya kupapusha ku menso yesu.”<verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />“Ekyo nkomyebati, Ubufumu bwakwa Lesa bukapokwa kuli mwebo no kupeelwa kubengatwalapo ifisabo. <verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />[Umuntu onse ukaponena pa kilibwe ki akafunaika, nomba uyo kikaponenapo akashinaika.”]<verse eid="MAT 21:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Banshimapepo bakindami na Bafalise pa kumfwa iyo milumbe, balilukile ati ebo akoeba. <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />Balifwaishe nshila ya kumwikatilamo nomba balifililwe pantu bali kutiina amabumba ya bantu abashininkishe ati Yesu ni kasesema.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s">Umulumbe wa mutebeto wa bwinga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luka14.15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Kabili Yesu ali kubomfye milumbe pa kulanda ku bantu ati, <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />“Ubufumu bwa mwiulu bwakuba nge mfumu imo iyapekanishishe umwana wakwe umwalalume umutebeto wa bwinga. <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />Yalitumine ababomfi pa kwebati bebeko abalalikwe ku mutebeto ati bese nomba nabo balikene ukwisa. <verse eid="MAT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />Ekyo yatumine ababomfi bambi ne ntumi, ‘Umutebeto ndipekenye, ing'ombe nasho shilipaiwe, iseni bonse ku bwinga pantu fyonse epo fili.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />Nomba abalalikwe tababikileko mano, kila muntu asupike fye inkito yakwe, umbi aile kwi bala kyakwe no munakwe naye aile ku bukwebo bwakwe. <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />Bambi nabo balikete balya basha, ukubapumaula no kubepaya. <verse eid="MAT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />Imfumu ya lifulilwe sana epakutumako ifita ifyaishile kwipaya filya fipondo no kufyokela umusumba. <verse eid="MAT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />Elo imfumu yalyebele na basha ati, ‘Umutebeto wa bwinga ulipekanishiwe, nomba abalalikilwe tabalingile. <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Kabuyeni fye nomba mu misebo no kuya kulalika bonse mukosangamo.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />Na balya babomfi epakuya mu misebo, ukuya kusendamo abantu bonse baile kusangamo, ababubi na babune ne nga'anda ya bwinga epakwisula sululu.<verse eid="MAT 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />“Ulo imfumu yaingilemo pa kubona abeni, ya bwenemo muntu umo uutafwele ilaya lya bwinga. <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />Epakumwipushati, ‘Kibusa, wasangwa shani muno ukwakubulwa ilaya lya bwinga?’ Nomba ulya muntu alifye kelele. <verse eid="MAT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />Elo imfumu yaebele abasha ati, ‘Mukakeni amaboko na molu no ku mupoosa panse mu mfinshi, kweko ko abantu bakule kulila no kusumanya meno.’”<verse eid="MAT 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />“Pantu bengi bakuutwa, nomba abasalwa banini.”<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikipusho palwa kulipila Umusonko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luka14.15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />Elo Abafalise ba pandishenye amano pa fyo bangesha Yesu mufipusho pa ku mufwailisha. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Elo batumineko abasambi babo na bena Helodi kuli Yesu. Balimwipwishe ati, “We kafundisha, twalishibati ulanda ikishika. Usambilisha ikine pa ku fwaya kwakwa Lesa pa bantu, kabili tautiina muntu nangu umo, ubona bonse ukwakubula akapatulula. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />Twebeko itontonkanyo lyobe. Bushe kyansambu ukulekulipila umusoko kuli Kaisale, kateeka wa ki Loma nangula tefyo?”<verse eid="MAT 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Yesu pa kwishiba amapinge yabo ayabubi alibasukile ati, “Mwe babumbimunda mwe! Nindo mukofwaila ukungesha? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Leteni indalama ya musonko.” Nabo epa kumuletela. <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />Yesu epakubepushati, “Kinso ne kikope fyakwa nani filipo?”<verse eid="MAT 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />Nabo balimwasukile ati, “Kaisale.” Elo Yesu abebele ati, “Kanshi mulekupeela kaisale ifyakwa Kaisale, kabili mulekupeela Lesa ifyakwa Lesa.”<verse eid="MAT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Pa kumfwe fyo balipapile sana, epakumusha.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikipusho palwa kushikuka ku bakufwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mako12.18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luka20.27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />Pa bushiku bulya bwine Abasaduke abatasumine ati kukaba ukushikuka kwa bakufwa balishile ne kipusho kuli Yesu <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />ati, “We Kafundisha, Mose alitwebele ati, Umwalalume ngafwa ukwakubula ukufyalapo abana, wabo ali no kupyana ulya mwanakashi pa kuti amufyalileko abana. <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Nomba palipo bawabo kine lubali. Umukulubantu alyupile mpaka afwa ukwakubula uku kwatapo abana, epakushiila wabo umukashi. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Uwa kibili, uwakitatu mpaka no wa kulenga kine lubali bonse balifwile. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />Kulipelwepelwe umwanakashi naye afwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Nomba pa kushikuka kwa bakufwa akesa kubo mukashi wakwa nani apo bonse balimupilepo?”<verse eid="MAT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Yesu alibasukile ati, “Muli bafilubo pantu tamwishibile amalembo nangula maka yakwa Lesa. <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Pantu ulo abakufwa bakashikuka, takwakabepo kuupa nangu kuupwa, bakesa kuba kubati ni bamalaika ba mwiulu. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Kabili pa mulandu wa kushikuka kwa bakufwa bushe tamwabelengapo palya Lesa aebele ati, <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />‘Ni nebo Lesa wakwa Ablahamu, Lesa wakwa Isaki, Lesa wakwa Yakobo.’ Ekyo ni Lesa wa bamweo te wa bakufwa.”<verse eid="MAT 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Amabumba ya bantu pa kumfwe fyo abasambilishe, balipapile.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikipope ilya ku kilapo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mako12.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka10.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Ulo Abafalise baumfwile ati Yesu atalalika Abasaduke, balikolongene pamo. <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />Elo umunabo umo, kafundisha wa mafunde alimwipwishe ikipusho pa kumwesha ati, <verse eid="MAT 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />“We kafundisha, kipope ndo ilyakukila pa mafunde yonse?”<verse eid="MAT 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />Yesu alimwasukile ati, “Ulekutemwa Shikulu Lesa obe no mutima obe onse, no mweo obe onse, na mano yobe yonse. <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Iki ekipope kyakubalilapo ikya kilapo pali fyonse. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />Nelya kulenga bubili lya kwebati, ‘Ulekutemwa umunobe nga wemwine.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Amafunde yakwa Mose yonse pamo na masambilisho ya bakasesema ya limbikila pali aya yabili.”<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bushe Klistu ni mwana nani?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mako12.35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luka20.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Ulo Abafalise bambi bakolongene, Yesu alibepwishe ati, <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />“Bushe mutontonkanyapo indo pali Messia? Bushe ni mwanna nani?” Nabo balimwasukile ati, “Ni mwana Davidi.”<verse eid="MAT 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Yesu epakubepusha kabili ati, “Bushe nindo Davidi uwatungulwilwe na Mupashi amukuutile ati, ‘Shikulu.’ Apo Davidi wine alimukuutile ati,<verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />“Shikulu aebele Imfumu yangi ati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">Wikale ku kwa mulyo kwangi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">mpakapo nkabikila abalwani bobe panshi ya makasa yobe.<verse eid="MAT 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />“Davidi nga mukuutile ‘Shikulu’, kuti kabili Messia aisakuba umwana wakwa Davidi?”<verse eid="MAT 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Tapalipo nelo umo uwa mwasukilepo, kabili ukufuma pali bulya bushiku, tapalipo nangu umo uwa mwipwishepo amepusho ayali yonse.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s">Kengeleni na Bafundisha ba mafunde na Bafalise</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Mako12.38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43">Luka11.43</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:46">46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-46">20.45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Elo Yesu aebele amabumba ya bantu na basambi bakwe <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />ati, “Bakafundisha bamafunde na Bafalise balikwatapo insambu shakulondolola amafunde yakwa Mose. <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />Ekyo mulingile ukumfwa no kukita fyonse fyo bakomisambilisha. Nomba mwile kupashanya ifikitwa fyabo pantu tabakonka ifyo basambilisha. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Bakakila abanabo ifipe ifyakulema sana pa mabeya, nomba bena tebakwesha no kwikatako nangu munwe umo. <verse eid="MAT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />Bakita fyonse pa kubonwa ku bantu. Baikakila no tupande twa malembo tumo uto bafwala pa mpumi na pa maboko. Elo ne nsenkebele sha nsalu shabo shakuleepa! <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />Balitemwa ifipuna fya bukindami mu ma Sinagoge ne nkende sha bune mu mitebeto. <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />Kabili balitemenwepo ukule kubaposha no mukinshi mu fisankano no kule kubakuuta ati, ‘Kafundisha.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />Mwile kukuutwa ati, ‘Kafundisha,’ pantu mwense muli bana nkashi abakwata fye Kafundisha umo. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />Kabili tekwesha uku kuutapo muntu nangu umo ati, ‘Tata,’ pantu mulikwetepo fye Tata umo uwa mwiulu. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />Na kabili, tamulingile ukukuutwa, ‘Kafundisha,’ pantu mulikwetepo fye kafundisha umo eka, ni Klistu. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />Umukulu pali mwebo alilingile ukuba e musha wenu. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Na onse ukoipanga ubukulu akakefiwa, no wa kuikefya akesa kusumbulwa.<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aebaula Abafalise na Bakafundisha ba mafunde</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:40">Mako12.40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-42">Luka11.39-42</ref>; 44; 52; <ref loc="LUK 20:47">20.47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13" />“Kalanda kuli mwebo Bakafundisha ba mafunde na Bafalise, babumbimunda! Mwisala pa mwenshi wa mwiulu pa kulesha abantu ukwingililapo. Mwebene tamwingililapo kabili tamuleka bambi ukwingililapo. <verse eid="MAT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14" />[Kalanda kuli mwebo bakafundisha bamafunde na mwe Bafalise babumbimunda! Mulila bamukamfwilwa ifyuma elo mulailanga na mu kupepa amapepo ya kuleepa, mu kakandwa apakulu!]<verse eid="MAT 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />“Kalanda kuli mwense bakafundisha ba mafunde na Bafalise, babumbimunda! Mwenda imilundu ne ntamfu ishakuleepa sana pa kuti fye muwikishepo muntu umo mu mapepo yenu, ulo mwakite fyo mu mulenga ukubipishapo pa miku ibili ukukishapo abelele.<verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />“Kalanda kuli mwebo bantungulushi mpofu! Apo mufunda ati, ‘Uwalapa pe Tempele, tali uwakukakwa ku mulapo, nomba nga alapa pali golide wa mwi Tempele, ninshi lwena alikakilwe.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Mwe fyungwa fya mpofu mwe, Bushe ikya kukindamapo kindo? Golide nangule Tempele ilisangulula golide? <verse eid="MAT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Kabili musambilisha ati, ‘uwalapa pa kipailo kyakwa Lesa, tali uwakukakwa ku mulapo wakwe, umfwa alapa pa kyapeelwa pa kipailo ninshi alikakilwe ku mulapo.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Mwe mpofu mwe. Ikya kukindamapo kindo? ikyabupe nangula ikipailo ikisangulula ikyabupe? <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Ekyo ulo muntu akolapa pa kipailo ninshi akolapa pekapo na pali kyonse ikyabupe kipeelelwepo. <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />Kabili ulo muntu akolapa pe Tempele, akolapa pekapo na pali Lesa uwikalamo. <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />Kabili ulo umo alapa kwiulu, akolapa pa kipuna kyakwa Lesa no waikalapo.<verse eid="MAT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />“Kalanda kuli mwebo Bakufundisha bamafunde na Bafalise, babumbimunda! Mwe bapeela imisalu ya kuwamya ifyakulya nge kyapekumi kuli Lesa. Nomba mwalifilwa fye ukumfwa no ku konka fye ifunde likindami ilya mulinganya, uluse na bukine. Ifi fyonse mwalilingile ukulekukita ukwakubula ukusuulapo fimbi. <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />Mwe ntungulushi mpofu mwe, mufwisa akashishi, elo mwamina ingamali.”<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />“Kalanda kuli mwebo Bakafundisha bamafunde na Bafalise, babumbimunda! Musamfya kunse ya lukombo ne mbale, nomba mukati muliswile bukabundulu na bukaitemwe. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Mwe Bafalise bampofu! Tampilenipo ukusuka mukati kalukombo, lwena kuti mwasuka na kunse!<verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />“Kalanda kuli mwebo Bakafundisha bamafunde na mwe Bafalise bampofu! Mwaba kubati ni nshishi bashingulako ilobwa lya kutuba, shiboneka bune bune kunse nomba mukati muliswile amafupa ya bakufwa na fimbipo ifya kubola. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />Na mwebo kunse mulaboneka fye ababune, nomba mukati muliswilemo bu bumbimunda no bubi bonse.<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asobela ukukandwa kwabo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:47-51">Luka11.47-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />“Kalanda kuli mwebo Bakafundisha bamafunde na mwe Bafalise babumbimunda! Mulaemfya inshishi sha bakasesema na bololoke. <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />kabili mwebati, ‘Umfwa atwikala mu nshita ulo ifikolwe fyesu fyalipo, fwebo nga tatwakitile fyo bakitile, ukwipaya bakasesema.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />Ekyo mulisumine ati fikolwe fyenu fyaipaile bakasesema. <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />Konkanyenipo fye mupwilikishe umulimo ifikolwe fyenu fyatampile. <verse eid="MAT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />Mwe nsoka na bana bansoka! Bushe mukafulumuka shani ubupingushi bwa ku ngehena? <verse eid="MAT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />Nandi nkale kumitumina bakasesema, abamano na bakafundisha bamafunde. Bambi mukesa kubepaya, bambi mukale kubatanika fye elo na bambi mukale kubapumaula mu ma Sinagoge no kule kubakonkakonka mu musumba umo no unakwe. <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />Ekyo ukukandwa pa mulandu wa kwipaya abakaele kukesakuba pali mwebo. Ukutampila pamulopa wakaele uwakwa Abele ukushinta fye na pali Sekaliya mwana Belechiya uyo mwaipaile pakati ke Tempele ne kipailo. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />Nkomwebati, fyonse fi fikesa kuponena pa ba nkulo ino.<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikitemwiko kyakwa Yesu pali Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Luka13.34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />“Yelusalemu webo Yelusalemu! We kepaya wa bakasesema no kupoola mabwe abo batuma kuli webo! Ni pamiku inga na fwaile ukufukatila abana bobe nga filya nankoko afukatila utwana mu mapindo yakwe? Nomba walikene! <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Ekyo, ing'anda yobe ikesa kushala kibolya. <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />Nkomyebati, ukufuma pali nomba tawakambonepo mpaka fye ulo ukalanda ati, ‘Wakushuka uyo eshila mwi shina lyakwa Shikulu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s">Yesu alanda pa konaika kwe Tempele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mako13.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luka21.5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Ulo Yesu ali kufuma mwi Tempele elo abasambi bakwe bamupalamine no kumulangilile fikuulwa abone ifyo fyakuulwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Yesu alibasukile ati, “Bushe mukobonefi fyonse? Nkomyebe kyakine tapalipo ibwe ilikashala pa mulu wa linakwe, yonse yakaponena panshi.”<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asobela amakyushi no kupakaswa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mako13.3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luka21.7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Ulo Yesu aikele pa Lupili lwa Miolife, abasambi balishile bakomwipusha mu nkaama ati, “Twebeko ulo iki kintu kikesa kukitika kabili kishibilo ndo ikya kwisa kobe pa ku langa impela ye sonde?”<verse eid="MAT 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Yesu alibasukile ati, “Mube abakwibukila, mwileka muntu nelo umo amilufye. <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />Pantu abengi bakesa bakolanda ati, ‘Ni nebo Klistu.’ Kabili bakalufya bengi. <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />Mukomfwa ifya bulwi ne mpupilisho sha bulwi, mwikasakamikwa pantu ifi fyonse fikesa kukitika, nomba ninshi impela tailati ifike.” <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Umushobo ukesa kwimina umushobo unakwe, elo bufumu bukesa kwimina ubufumu bunakwe. Kukesa kubapo ne fipowe ne finkunkuma mu nkende isha ku pusana pusana. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Ifi fyonse fikaba fye entampilo yabu kyushi bwa kupaapa umwana.<verse eid="MAT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />Elo ba kamikata, uku mikyusha no ku mipaya. Imishobo yonse ikamipatila pali nebo. <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />Abengi bakalufishamo ikiteketelo, ukule kuyalukila no kule kuipata abene na bene. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />Elo bakasesema babufi abengi nabo bakesa kulufya bengi. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Pantu ububifi bukafula, ukutemwa ku kafubalila ku bengi. <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />Nomba uyo akashipikisha mpaka fye na ku mpela eukesa kupusuka. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />Ne Mbila Yabune iyi ya Bufumu ikesa kubilwa ku ba pesonde bonse pa kuba bunte ku mishobo yonse, elo nomba impela ikesa.<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umupamba wa kipeshamano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Mako13.14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka21.20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />“Ulo mukabona umupamba wa bonaushi uo kasesema Daniele alandilepo, wasangwa mwi Tempele.” (uukobelenga na eluke) <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />elo abakaba mu Yudea ba kafulumukile ku mpili. <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />Uyo akasangwa pa mutenge, ekekila pa kuya kusendamo ifipe mung'anda. <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />No ukaba mwi bala naye ekema ukuya kufwayapo mwingila wakwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Kalanda ku banakashi bakaba pabukulu na bakalekonsha abana pali ilya nshita! <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Mulekupepa pa kwebati fikakitika mu mupepo nangula pe Sabata! <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />Pantu ubo bukyushi bukakulishapo pa bukyushi bonse bwaliko kale ukutampa fye apo isonde lyalengelwe kabili ta bwakese kubako kuntanshi. <verse eid="MAT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />Pantu isho nshiku nga tashakepelako, tapangaba ungapusuka, nomba ni pa mulandu wa basalwa bakwe, epo shikesa kefeshiwa.<verse eid="MAT 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />“Ekyo umo nga amyebati, ‘Klistu uno alipano,’ nangula ‘Ulya ali palya!’ Mwikasumina. <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />Pantu ba Klistu babufi na bakasesema babufi bakafula no kulekita ifisungusho ne fipeshamano ifikulu pa kwebati ngakingakitwa bakabepe na basalwa bene. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Kutikisheni, nkomyebela libela.<verse eid="MAT 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />“Ekyo nga bamyebati, ‘Klistu ali mu kiswebebe,’ mwikayako nangula baebati, ‘Uyu ali mung'anda,’ mwikasumina. <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />Pantu Mwana wa Muntu akesa kubati ni filya umwele wankuba ubyasha mwiulu monse, ukutampila ku kabanga ukufika ku mbonshi.<verse eid="MAT 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />“Pantu apali ikitumbi, epo na makubi ya kakolongana.”<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukwisa kwa Mwana wa Muntu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mako13.24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka21.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />“Panuma ya bulya bukyushi, akasuba kakafiita fititi, umwenshi ta wa kaakepo, ne ntanda shikaponena panshi. Na maka ya mwiulu ya katenkana. <verse eid="MAT 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />Elo ne kishibilo kya Mwana wa Muntu kikabonekela mwiulu, ne mishobo yonse ikaloosha pa kubona Umwana wa Muntu akoisa mu makumbi mu maka no bukindami ubukulu. <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />Ulo ipenga lya kiunda ikikulu likomfwika, elo akatuma bamalaika bakwe ukufuma muntunga shonse sha pesonde kabili bakakolonganika abasalwa bakwe ukufuma ukwatampile ulu no kufika kumpela yaiko.<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikishibilo kya mukunyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mako13.28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luka21.29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />“Sambililenipo ku kimuti kya mukunyu. Ulo amabula yafuunda, yalelema, muleshiba ati, amainsa yalipalamine. <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Ekyo ulo mwabone fikokitika, mwishibile ati nshita ilipalamine. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />Nkomyeba mu kine kine ati, inkulo ino tayakapitepo mpaka fyonse fikakitike. <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />Iulu ne sonde fikapita, nomba ikyebo kyandi ta kyakapitepo.”<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tapalipo uwaishiba ubushiku nangu kashita</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Mako13.32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luka17.26-30</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />Tapalipo nangu umo uwaishiba ubushiku nangula kashita ulo Mwana wa Muntu akesa. Nangula fye ba malaika mwiulu, nangu fye Mwana kano fye Tata eka ena alishibile. <verse eid="MAT 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />Ukwisa kwa Mwana wa Muntu tungakupalakanya kufyo kyali pali Noa. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Ulo takulaba ilyenshi, abantu bali kunwa, bali kuupa, no kuupwa, ukushinta napo Noa aninine mu kibwange. <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />Tabailukilepo ikyali kukitika mpake lyenshi lyaisakubalofya bonse. Fyeke fyo kikesakuba pa kwisa kwa Mwana wa Muntu. <verse eid="MAT 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />Pali ilyanshita, abalalume babili bakalekubomba mwibala, umbi akasendwa, umbi akashala. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Abanakashi babili bakalekupela pebwe, umbi akasendwa, umbi akashala. <verse eid="MAT 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />Mulekwibukila pantu tamwishibile ubushiku ulo Shikulwinwe akesa. <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Umwine wa ng'anda ngalishibile ulo umun'go akoisa mu kwiba, kuti alola bobuno pa kwebati eleka besekutoba ing'anda yakwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Ekyo nomba mulekuipekanya lonse apo Umwana wa Muntu akesa pa nshita ulo mutenekele.<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umubomfi wa kishinka no utali wa kishinka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luka12.41-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />Ni nani umubomfi wa kishinka na mano? Ni ulya shikukulu wakwe alashika pali bukangalila pa banakwe ukulekubapeela ifyakulya pa nshita ya kulinga. <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Ulya mubomfi akasansamuka ulo shikulu wakwe akamusanga akobomba bwino. <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />Nkomyeba mukine ati, shikulu wakwe akamulashika bukangalila pa fyuma fyakwe fyonse. <verse eid="MAT 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />Nomba ngali mubomfi wabubi, akebati apo shikulu akokola pa kubwela, <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />no kutampa ukupumaula abanakwe, ukulekulya no kunwina pamo na ba kyakolwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />Shikulu wakwe akesa panshita ulo mubomfi wakwe teshibile nangu kwenekela. <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />Ulya mubomfi akesa kuputaulwa tupimfya tupimfya kabili akesa kubikwa pamo na babumbimunda, Kukesakuba ukulila no kusumanya meno.<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s">Umulumbe wa banakisungu ikumi limo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />“Ubufumu bwa mwiulu kuti twabupalakanya kuli banakisungu ikumi limo abasendele ututolitoli twabo abali kulolela nshibwinga. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />Pali aba bonse, basano bali bamano, elo bambi basano bali fyungwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />Ifyungwa fyalisendele ututolitoli umwakubulamo amafuta. <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />Nomba abamano bena balisendele amafuta mu mabotolo. <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Nomba ikyo nshibwinga akokola pa kwisa, elo banakisungu bonse balitampile ukushipula mpaka baponena mutulo.”<verse eid="MAT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />“Pa kati ka bushiku baumfwa inkuuta, ikoebati, ‘Nshibwinga aisa twendeni tumusekelele!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />Elo bonse ba alamuka no kumosha ututolitoli twabo. <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />Elo ifyungwa fyaebele abamano ati, ‘Tupeelenipo amafuta pantu ututolitoli twesu fwebo tukoshima.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />Abanabo balibasukile ati, ‘Nafwebo tulikwetepo fye ayo tungabomfya fwebene tayengakumana na kuli mwebo. Kabuyeni fye kubashitisha pakwebati muyekuishitila fye mwe bene.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />Ulo ifyungwa fyaile mukushita amafuta, elo na nshibwinga naye afikile. Banakisungu basano abaipekenye balingile mung'anda ya bwinga ne kibi kyaliselweko.<verse eid="MAT 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />“Pa numa elo ifyungwa na fyo fyafika panse no kwamba ukukuuta ati, ‘twiswileniko mukwai.’” <verse eid="MAT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />Nshibwinga naye alibasukile ati, “Nkomyeba mukine ati, Ntamishibile.”<verse eid="MAT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />Ekyo mulekuba abaibukila apo tapali uwaishibila ubushiku bulya nangu kashita.<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umulumbe wa babomfi batatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luka19.11-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />“Ubufumu bwa mwiulu kuti twa bupalakanya ku muntu umo uwakwete ababomfi batatu no ku bashiila bukangalila pa fipe fyakwe epakuya na pa lwendo. <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />Alipeele kuli kila umo ukulingana na maka akwetepo. Kuli umo kwalipeelwe indalama amatalanta yasano. Na kuli umbi naye kwalipeelwe yabili elo na kuli umbi kwalipeelwe fye italanta limo. <verse eid="MAT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Uwapokele indalama amatalanta yasano aliyabikile mu bukwebo mpaka alundapo na yambi yasano. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />No wa kibili naye ailekulundapo na yambi yabili. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Nomba uyo wa peelwe limo ena talundilepo pantu aile kwimba fye ikilindi emo afisa.<verse eid="MAT 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />“Ulo pa pitilepo inshita iyakulepa sana, ulya muntu alibwelele. Epakwita na babomfi bakwe pa kuti bengalondolola ifyo bali kubomfya ifyuma fyakwe. <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Uwapokele indalama amatalanta yasano, alundilepo na shimbi amatalanta yasano no kulanda ati, ‘Shikulu mwamfobweshe indalama amatalanta yasano, ekyo ndilundilepo na yambi yasano.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />Elo shikulu wakwe alimwebele ati, ‘Wakita bwino we mubomfi wabune kabili uwakishinka! Pali bukishinka walanga pa tunini, nkokulashika pa fya kufula. Isa wingile mukusekelela kwakwa wisokulu.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />Elo uwapokele indalama amatalanta yabili naye aisa ati, ‘Shikulu pa ndalama amatalanta yabili mwampeele, na lilundilepo na yambi yabili.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />Shikulu wakwe alimwebele ati, ‘wakita bwino we mubomfi musuma, apo waba uwakishinka pa tunini, nomba nkokulashika pa fyakufula. Isa wingile munsansa shakwa wisokulu!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />Nomba ku wapokele indalama italanta limo ena alyebele ati, ‘Mukwai ndishibile ati uli muntu wa kwafya pantu usombola napo tawabyele kabili ukolonganika napo tawakushile imbuto. <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />Nalikwete umwenso ekyo nailekushika fye indalama shenu mu mushili. Buleni nomba indalama shenu ishi.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />Nomba shikulu wakwe ena alimwasukile ati, ‘we musha wabubi no bulese! Apo walishibile ati nebo nsombola apontabyele kabili nkolonganika apo ntakushile imbuto. <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />Nga wantwalile indalama kuli bakasunga pa kwebati naisakusanga balimbikilepo kansonsela. <verse eid="MAT 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />Mupokeni indalama shakwe no kupeela kuli ulya ukwete amatalanta ikumi limo. <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />Pantu onse uukwete ififulile akapokelapo na fimbi, nomba kuli uyo utakwetepo nangu kamo, akapokwa no tunini akwatapo. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />Nomba iki kingulyalya kya mubomfi kyena mukipose fye kunse mu mfinshi uko abantu bakalekulila no kusumanya ameno.’<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubupingushi bwa kupelekeshako</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />“Ulo Mwana wa Muntu akesa nge Mfumu mu bukindami pamo na bamalaika bakwe, akesa kwikala pa kipuna kyabukindami bwakwe. <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />Na bantu bamishobo yonse bakakolongana ku kinso kyakwe. Elo akesa kubapatukanya mu mabumba yabili nge fyo umukemi apatukanya imbelele ne mbushi. <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />Akabika abololoke ku kwa mulyo kwakwe elo imbifi kipiko kwakwe. <verse eid="MAT 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />Elo Imfumu ikesa kweba abakabela ku kwa mulyo kwakwe ati, ‘Iseni mwebapaalwa kuli Tata, mwingile mu Bufumu ba mipekanishishe pa kutampa fye kwe sonde. <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />Nalipo ne nsala, mwalimpeleko ikyakulya, nalipo ne kilaka, mwalimpeleko amenshi. Kabili ulo nalipo umweni, mwalinsekelele. <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />Ulo nabulilwe ikyakufwala mwalimfwikile, nelo nalwele mwalintenseshe. Ulo nali mu kifungo mwalimpempwilepo.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />Elo abololoke bakebati, ‘Ni lwisa Shikulu apo twamibwene mulyumfwile nsala, elo twamipelako ikyakulya nangula mwalipo ne kilaka elo twamipelako ikyakunwa? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Ni lwisa ulo mwali abeni elo twamisekelela kwesu nelo mwalipo abakubulwa ikyakufwala na fwebo twaisa kumifwika? <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Ni lwisa ulo twamibwene mulilwele no kumitensha nangula mukifungo elo twamipempulako?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />Elo Imfumu ikasukati, ‘Pali kyonse ikyo wakitile abakukepeshapo, wakitile kuli nebo!’<verse eid="MAT 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />“Elo akeba abali kukipiko kwakwe ati, ‘Fumeni apa mwebakutipwa, kabuyeni ku mulilo wapee uo bapekanishishe Kiwa na bamalaika bakwe. <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />Pantu nali ne nsala tamwampeleko ikyakulya, nali ne kilaka tamwampeleko amenshi ya kunwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />Kabili ulo nali mweni, tamwansekelele mwenu mu mayanda. Ulo ntakwete ifyakufwala, tamwamfwikile nolo nalwele, nolo nali mukifungo tamwampempwile,’ <verse eid="MAT 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />Elo bakesa kumwasukati, ‘Ni lwisa ulo twakubwene ulikwete insala, ne kilaka, nangula umweni, uwakubulwa ikyakufwala, umulwele nangula fye ni mukifungo ukwakubula ukukwafwa?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />Elo Imfumu ikesa kubebati, ‘Nkomyebati lonse ulo muta afwileko abakukepesha, ni nebo mwakanine ukwafwa.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />Aba bonse bakesa kupooswa mukukandwa kwa muyayaya, nomba abololoke bena ni ku mweo wa muyayaya eko bakaya.”<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s">Bapinga ukwipaya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mako14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka22.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yowane11.45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Pa kupwisha ukusambilisha ifi fyonse, Yesu alyebele abasambi bakwe ati,<verse eid="MAT 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />“kwashalako fye nshiku shibili ninshi twaingila mu mutebeto we pasaka elo no Mwana wa Muntu ali no kwi katwa no kwisa kutanikwa.”<verse eid="MAT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Elo banshimapepo bakindami na bakilolo balikolongene pamo kung'anda yakwa nshimapepo mukulu, Kefasi. <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />Eko bali kupingana pa fyo bangekata Yesu mu bumfisolo no kumwipaya <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />Balyebele ati, “Teti tukite fyo pa nshita ya mutebeto epali abantu baimye kimfulunganya.”<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ba musuba amafuta ku Betani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mako14.3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yowane12.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Ulo Yesu aile ku Betani alingile mung'anda yakwa Simoni wa fibashi, <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />elo mwaishilepo mwanakashi umo ne botolo lya mafuta ya ku nunkila kwa bune kabili ayamutengo sana, apo ninshi Yesu akolya. Epakwitulwila ayo mafuta pa mutwi wakwa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Abasambi pa kubone fyo kyalibashikitile, epakwebati, “Nindo bako onawila ya mafuta?” <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />“Pantu aya mafuta nga kuyakushitisha kuti twakwatapo indalama ishakufula no kupeelako abalanda.”<verse eid="MAT 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Nomba Yesu alishibile fyo bali kulanda, alibebele ati, “Nindo mukokyushisha umwanakashi uyu? Tapalipo mulandu akita pali nebo. <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />Abalanda mwalekuba nabo lonse nomba tamwakabepo na nebo lonse. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Ifi aitulwila mafuta pali nebo kumpekanya kwa kushikwa kwangi. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />Mukine nkomyebati, konse fye uko Imbila Yabune ikayakubilwa, ikyo mwanakashi akita pano kikashimbulwapo nge kibukisho kyakwe.”<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda asumina ukwalukila Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mako14.10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luka22.3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Elo umo pa basambi ikumi limo na babili uwe shina lya Yuda Iskalioti, aile kuli banshimapepo bakindami, <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />mukubepushati, “Nindo mukampeela nga nkamiletele Yesu?” Nabo epakumupendela indalama sha silfele amakumi yatatu. <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />Pekapo, Yuda ali kufwailisha fye nshita ilingilile ukumwikatilapo.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na basambi bakwe balila pamo Ipasaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mako14.12-21</ref>; Luka22.7-13, 21-23; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yowane13.21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />Pa bushiku bwa ku tampilapo ubwa kulilamo imikate itatutumuka, abasambi baishile kuli Yesu ne kipusho ati, “Bushe nipi ukofwaya tuye kupekanisha webo Ipasaka?”<verse eid="MAT 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />Yesu alibasukile ati, “Kabuyeni mukosanga umwalalume umo mu musumba,” muye kumwebati, “Kafundisha aebati, Inshita yangi ilipalamine, nkoisa kuliila Ipasaka kobe ku ng'anda pamo na basambi bangi.”<verse eid="MAT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Abasambi baile kupekanya Ipasaka nge fyo abebele.<verse eid="MAT 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Pakyungulo, Yesu na basambi bakwe ikumi limo na babili ba lyandalele ku kulya. <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />Ulo bali bakolya, Yesu alibebele ati, “Nkomyeba mukine ati, umo pali mwebo akongalukila.”<verse eid="MAT 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Abasambi balisakamikilwe, kabili balitampile ukulekumwipusha umo umo ati, “Bushe ni nebo Shikulu?”<verse eid="MAT 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />Yesu alibasukile ati, “Uukoshimpikila umukate mu nsani pamo na nebo ninshi eweko yo. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />Umwana wa Muntu ali no kufwa nga filya kyalembwa, nomba kalanda kuli uyo akomwalukila. Nga kyaliwemepo uyo muntu nga ta fyelwe!”<verse eid="MAT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Elo Yuda uwa mwalukile alipwishe ati, “Bushe ni nebo Shikulu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:25">Yesu alimwasukile ati, “Ulilandile ati ni webo wine.”<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umulalilo wakwa Shikulu Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mako14.22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka22.14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Kolinto11.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Ulo bali bakolya Yesu alibulile umukate, atashishe no kupesaula elo apeele na ku basambi bakwe ati, “Buleni mulye, uyu e mubili wangi.”<verse eid="MAT 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Elo kabili alibulile ulukombo, atashishe Lesa no kubapeela ati, “Nwenimo mwense. <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />Uyu e mulopa wa kipingano kyangi uukoitulukila pa mulandu wa bantu abakuti ubwingi pa kwelelwa kwa membu shabo. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />Nkomyebati ntakanwepo libili ifisabo fya ku mwangashi mpaka fye bulya bushiku ulo tukesa kunwa pamo fwense umwangashi upya mu Bufumu bwakwa Tata.”<verse eid="MAT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Pa kupwisha fye ukwimba ulwimbo, epakuya ku lupili lwa Miolife.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asobela uku kaanwa kuli Petelo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mako14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka22.31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yowane13.36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Elo Yesu aebele abasambi ati, “Buno bwine bushiku mwense mu kombutuka pantu kyalilembwati, ‘Nkoma umukemi ne mbelele shikapalangana.’ <verse eid="MAT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />Nomba pa numa ya ku shikuka kwangi, nkamitangilila ku Galile.”<verse eid="MAT 26:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Petelo epakulanda ati, “Nebo ntakamishe nangula aba bonse bangamisha.”<verse eid="MAT 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />Yesu alimwasukile ati, “Buno bweko bushiku, ulo mukolwe talati kulila, ukonkaana imiku itatu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Petelo alimwasukile ati, “Nangu ningafwa na mwebo, nebo teti mikaane.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:35">Na basambi bambi nabo balilandile kimo kine.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu apepa mu Getisemani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mako14.32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luka22.39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Elo Yesu atwele abasambi bakwe ku nkende ya Getisemani epakubebati, “Ngale ikaleni pano ulo nkoya palya mu kupepa.” <verse eid="MAT 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />Ali na Petelo na bamwana Sebede babili. Abonekele uwa bulanda kabili uwa kusakamikwa sana. <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />Epakubeba ati, “Ndiketwe ubulanda sana ku mutima pepi fye ne mfwa.”<verse eid="MAT 26:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />Kabili aendeleleko pa ntanshi panini, aipoosa panshi no ku pepa ati, “Mwe Tata, ngakingakitwa, lekeni ulu lukombo lupite pali nebo. Nomba tekufwaya kwangi, kano ukufwaya kwenu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Ulo abwekelemo kubasambi bakwe alisangile balilele, epakweba Petelo ati, “Nindo mwebo mwafililwa ukulola pamo na nebo nangula fye pa nsa imo? <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />Loleni no kupepa epali mwaponena mu matunko. Umupashi ukofwaya lelo mubili ulinakile.”<verse eid="MAT 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Na kabili Yesu alibwekelemo mukupepa ati, “Mwe Tata, ulu lukombo nga talungapita kano fye nwinemo, ukufwaya kwenu ku kitwe.” <verse eid="MAT 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Kabili alibwekele ukwali abasambi bakwe no kusanga balilele, bali kufilwa ukulola.<verse eid="MAT 26:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Kabili Yesu alishiile abasambi no kuya kupepa pa muku wa kitatu akolanda mashiwi yamo yene. <verse eid="MAT 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Ulo abwekelemo ku basambi alibebele ati, “Bushe mukili mulilele no kulekutuusha? Boneni inshita ilipalamine ulo Mwana wa Muntu akapooswa mu minwe ya mbifi. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Alamukeni, boneni aisa uwakungalukila.”<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ba mwikata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mako14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka22.47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yowane18.3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Yesu ulo ali kulanda, elo Yuda, umo pa basambi afika pamo ne bumba ilikulu ukufuma kuli banshimapepo bakindami na bakilolo, balikwete na mapanga, ne misumbo. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Uwamwalukile alibebele ati, “Ikyakwishibilako mukobona uyo nkotomona, ninshi eweko yo, kumwikata.” <verse eid="MAT 26:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Yuda naye epakulungama fye apabelele Yesu no kumwebati, “Umutende kuli webo kasambilisha!” Elo amutomwene.<verse eid="MAT 26:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Yesu alimwasukile ati, “Kibusa, kita ikyo konkele kuno.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:50">Elo baishile kwikata Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Elo umo pali balya bali pamo na Yesu abulile ulupanga no kutempulako ukutwi kwa musha wakwa nshimapepo mukulu. <verse eid="MAT 26:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />Yesu alimwebele ati, “Bwekesha ulupanga mu kikwama kya luko pantu uwanga no lupanga akafwa kulupanga. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />Bushe tawishibile ati, nga natemwa kuti naeba Tata atuma kinkupiti wa bamalaika ukukila pa mabumba amakumi yabili? <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Nomba tali kano fye ikyalembwa kya fikilishiwa ati kilingile kyabe fyo?”<verse eid="MAT 26:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Elo Yesu alandile ku mabumba ya bantu pali ilya nshita ati, “Nindo mwaishila kuli nebo na mapanga ne misumbo kubati ndikapondo? Nali kuba nenu mwi Tempele ukwakubulapo kunjikata. <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Nomba fyonse fikokitika pa kufikilisha ifyo bakasesema balandile.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:56">Elo abasambi bonse balifulumukile no kumusha fye eka.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mu kilye kya Bayunda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Mako14.53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luka22.54-55</ref>; 63-71; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yowane18.13-14</ref>; 19-24)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Bamutwele ku ng'anda yakwa kefasi, nshimapepo mukulu ukwakolongene bakafundisha bamafunde na bakilolo. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Petelo naye alikonkele pa numa akatalamukila no lubansa lwa ng'anda yakwa nshimapepo mukulu epakwikala na balinshi pakubona ifyo kili no kuba. <verse eid="MAT 26:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Banshimapepo bakindami na banshikilye bonse bali kufwailisha bukambone bwa bufi pakwebati Yesu bamwipaye, <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />nomba balifililwe, nangu abengi bapeele ubunte bwabufi baikyushishe fye. Kulipelwepelwe abalalume babili balimakene <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />ati, “Uyu muntu ali kulandati, ‘Ndikwetepo amaka ya kubongolole Tempele no kulikuula pa nshiku shitatu.’”<verse eid="MAT 26:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Nshimapepo mukulu alimakene no kweba Yesu ati, “Bushe webo taukwetepo ikyasuko pali ubu bunte aba bantu bakokutunganya?” <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Nomba Yesu alifye kelele. Kabili nshimapepo mukulu alimwebele ati, “Mwishina lyakwa Lesa wa mweo, lapa fye nga ni webo Klistu, Mwana Lesa.”<verse eid="MAT 26:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />Naye Yesu alyasukile ati, “Ulilandile ati ni nebo wine. Nomba nkomyeba mwense ati, ukufuma pali nomba, mukabona Umwana wa Muntu alikele ku kwa mulyo kwa wa Maka Yonse no kwisa kufuma mu makumbi ya mwiulu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />Palikyo nshimapepo mukulu alilepawile ikyakufwala no kulandati, “Mwense muliyumfwilile ifyo akoponta. <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />Mukotipo shani?” Nabo balyasukile ati, “Wa milandu yo alingile fye ukufwa.”<verse eid="MAT 26:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Epakumushipila amate pa kinso, ukumupumaula, na bali kumupama amapi, <verse eid="MAT 26:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />balimwebele ati, “Klistu, Sesema kuli fwebo! Nani wakuuma?”<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petelo akaana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Mako14.66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luka22.56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yowane18.15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Pekapo ninshi Petelo alikele panse ulo umo kisotwe pa basha bakwa nshimapepo mukulu alilandile ati, “Na webo wine wali kuba nakwe Yesu umwina Galile.”<verse eid="MAT 26:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Nomba naye alikene pa kinso kya balipo bonse ati, “Nteshibile ikyo ukolandapo webo.” <verse eid="MAT 26:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Elo aile lwapa mwenshi wa lubansa, umwanakashi umbi naye umusha pa kumubona alyebele abalalume bali palya ati, “Uyu naye alipamo na Yesu umwina Nasaleti.”<verse eid="MAT 26:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Nalo Petelo alikene ati, “Nkolapa nebo ntamwishibapo uyo muntu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Kangu kangu fye palishilepo abalalume baimanine peka pali Petelo bamwebati, “Kyakine wali pamo naye pantu fye no musango ukolandilamo ukolanga.”<verse eid="MAT 26:73" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Petelo alimwasukile ati, “Nkolapa mu kine ntamwishibapo uyo muntu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:74">Pekapo na mukolwe alila. <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />Elo Petelo aibwishe fyo Yesu amwebele ati, “Ulo mukolwe talati kulila, ukonkaana imiku itatu ati tawangishiba.” Epakufumina panse no kuyakulila sana.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s">Yesu bamutwala kuli Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mako15.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Luka23.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Yowane18.28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Pa makya, banshimapepo bakindami na bakilolo bali kupingana ifyo Yesu banga mwipaya. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />Epakumukakila mu minyololo no ku mutwala kuli Pilato, umulashi wa ki Loma.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda aikulika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 1:18-19">Imilimo1.18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Ulo Yuda, uwamwalukile aishibile ati Yesu balimupingwilile ukufwa, alilangulukile, epakuya kuli banshimapepo bakindami na bakilolo no ku babwekesesha indalama sha silfele amakumi yatatu. <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />Epakubebati, “Ndibembukile pa kwipaisha uwakaele!” Nabo balimwasukile ati,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:4">“Uyo te mulandu kuli fwebo, lobe we mwine!”<verse eid="MAT 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Yuda ailekupoosa indalama mwi Tempele. Ukufumapo, kuyakuikulika.<verse eid="MAT 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Banshimapepo bakindami epakutoola shilya ndalama elo balyebele ati, “Ishi ni ndalama shamisoka teti shibikwe mu kipao kye Tempele, takyasuminishiwa.” <verse eid="MAT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Ulo bapingushenye balibulile indalama no kuyakushitamo ibala lya muntu umo uwali kubumba inongo umwakwebati balekushikamo abeni. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Ekyo ukufika na kali lelo, ili bala balikuuta ati, “Ibala lya mulopa.”<verse eid="MAT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Epakufikilisha ifyo kasesema Yelemia alembele ati, “Babulile indalama sha silfele amakumi yatatu, e mutengo abena Islaeli bapingwile uku mushitishapo. <verse eid="MAT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />Indalama bashitilemo ibala lyakwa kabumba wa nongo nge fyo Shikulu angebekeshe.”<verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pilato aipusha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Mako15.2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luka23.3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Yowane18.33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Ulo baletele Yesu ku mulashi, umulashi naye alimwipwishe ati, “Bushe ni webo Imfumu ya Bayuda?” Yesu alimwasukile ati,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:11">“Ulilandile.” <verse eid="MAT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />Nomba ulo banshimapepo bakindami na bakilolo bali kumushinika, tayasukilepo.<verse eid="MAT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Pilato epakwipusha Yesu ati, “Bushe ukoumfwa ifyo bakokwebaula?”<verse eid="MAT 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Nomba Yesu tayasukilepo nangu kamo, kabili umulashi kyalimupapwishe sana.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bapingwila Yesu ukufwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mako15.6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka23.13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yowane18.39—19.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />Nomba kila mwaka pa Mutebeto wa kya ku kilila kwali kubapo musango wakwebati umulashi abakakwilapo mufungwa umo uo abantu bangafwaya. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Pali ilya nshita palipo mufungwa umo uwaishibikilwe sana uweshina lya Baraba. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Ulo ibumba lya bantu lya kolongene, Pilato alipwishe ati, “Bushe ni nani mukofwayati mikakwile? Ni Baraba nangula Yesu uuwitikwa ati, Klistu?” <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Pantu Pilato alishibile ati ni kumufimbila fye bamuleteleko.<verse eid="MAT 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Ninshi Pilato alikele pa kipuna mung'anda ya bupingulo, umukashi wakwe alitumine ntumi ati, “Wiesha ku kitapo kantu nangu kamo pali uyo muntu pantu nkyulile bushiku bonse mu kiloto palwa uyo muntu.”<verse eid="MAT 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Nomba banshimapepo bakindami na bakilolo bali kusokesha ibumba lya bantu pakwebati balombe Pilato ukulekelako Baraba no kwipaya Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Pilato naye epakwipusha ibumba ati, “Nani pali aba babili mukofwayati mikakwile?” Nabo pa kupunda balyebele ati,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:21">“Ni Baraba!”<verse eid="MAT 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Pilato alibepwishe ati, “Nomba nkite ndo pali Yesu uuwitikwa ati, Klistu?” Bonse balyasukile ati, “Mutanikeni!” <verse eid="MAT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />Pilato alibepwishe ati, “Mulandu ndo apangile?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:23">Elo batampile ukupundisha ati, “Mutanikeni!”<verse eid="MAT 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />Pilato pa kubonati abantu tabanganashiwa kabili kuti paima ikimfulunganya, epakubula amenshi no kusamba ku minwe pa kinso kyebumba epakubeba ati, “Ntasangilepo mulandu nangu umo pali uyu muntu uwakwebati mupingwilepo kufwa. Mukiteni ikyo mukofwaya mwebene.”<verse eid="MAT 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Elo abantu bonse balyasukile ati, “Lekeni umulopa wakwe ube pali fwebo na pa bana besu!”<verse eid="MAT 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Pilato akakwile Baraba panuma ya ku mufopaula sana ifyembya epakumuleka aye kutanikwa.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ifita fya punika Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Mako15.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yowane19.2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Ulo ifita fyakwa Pilato fyatwele Yesu mu kipango kya mulashi, ne mpuka yonse yalimushingulukile. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />Epakumufula insalu shakwe no kumufwika umwingila uwakukashika. <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />Elo bapangile ikisote kya bufumu ikya myunga no kubika pa mutwi wakwe ne tete mu kuboko kwa mulyo kwakwe no kulekumufukamina mukapuni bakomweba ati, “Kanabesa we Mfumu ya Bayuda!” <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />Balimushipile amate no ku buula itete ukulekumuma pa mutwi. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Panuma ya kapuni, balimufulile umwingila, bamubwekeseshe insalu yakwe no kumufwika epakumutwala ku kutanikwa.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atanikwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mako15.21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka23.26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yowane19.17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />Ulo bali mukuya, ba kumenye umwalalume umo, Simoni umwina kilene. Ifita fyalimupatikishe ukusenda ulupanda lwa kwa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Bafikile pa nkende iyo bali kukuuta, Gologota ikyapilibwila mukuti, “Inkende ya kabongoselo.” <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />Epakumupeele umwangashi uwasankanishiwa ne ndusha, nomba alifililwe ukunwa panuma ya ku kimfulamo.<verse eid="MAT 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />Epakumutanika no kupendula pa kwakanya insalu shakwe. <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />Elo baikele panshi bakomulonda. <verse eid="MAT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Peulu lya mutwi balibikilepo ikipampa apo balembele amashiwi ya ku mwebawilapo ati, “Uyu ni Yesu Imfumu ya Bayuda.” <verse eid="MAT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />Elo bamutanikile pamo no tupondo tubili, kambi ku kwa mulyo na kambi kipiko kwakwe.<verse eid="MAT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />Abali kupita mu nshila bali kutekanya fye imitwi no kulekutuka Yesu ifimasele ati, <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />“Walilandile ati uli no kubongolola Itempele no kuli kuula munshiku fye shitatu, ipusushe we mwine nga ni webo Mwana Lesa, itulukapo pa lupanda.”<verse eid="MAT 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />Banshimapepo bakindami, bakafundisha bamafunde pamo na bakilolo bali kumufuupula. <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />Bali kumwebati, “Apuswishe bambi, nomba afilwa ukuipususho mwine! Bushe ii te Mfumu ya Islaeli? Nga etuluke pa lupanda nomba pa kwebati tumuteketele. <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" />Alisumina muli Lesa kabili alailanga ati, ‘Ndi Mwana Lesa, tukobona nga kuti Lesa amupususha nomba.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 27:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />No tupondo twa tanikilwe pamo naye nato twine twali kumutukaula masele.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu afwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mako15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka23.44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:28-30">Yowane1.28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Ulo akasuba kafikile pakati ka mutwi (12:00 koloko), ikyalo kyonse kyakupilwemo imfinshi iyapwile insa shitatu. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Panshita ya 15:00 koloko, Yesu apundile ishiwi ilikulu ati, “Eloi, Eloi, lamasabakatani? Ikyapilibwila mukwebati, Lesa wandi, Lesa wandi, nindo wandekelesesha?”<verse eid="MAT 27:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Abantu bambi abaimanine palya pa kumfwa baebele ati, “Akokuuta Eliya!” <verse eid="MAT 27:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Umo pali balya aswatuka no kuyakutumpiko mwepu mu mwangashi uwakukantuka no kupombelekesha kwitete. Epakumupeela ati anwe.<verse eid="MAT 27:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Nomba bambi nabo balyebele ati, “Natupembeleko tubone umfwa Eliya akoisa kumupususha!”<verse eid="MAT 27:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Elo kabili Yesu pa kupundisha mwishiwi likulu, alekele na ku mweo.<verse eid="MAT 27:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />Pekapo, ikisalu kya tanikilwe mwi Tempele kyalilepukilemo pa kati, ukwambila peulu mpaka panshi. Ikyalo nakyo kyali tenkene, na mabwe yalisanaikile. <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />Inshishi shalisukile, na bamushilo abengi balishikukile ku bakufwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />Balifumine mu nshishi panuma Yesu ashikukile ku bakufwa. Balile kwingila mu Musumba wa Mushilo na bengi balibabwenepo.<verse eid="MAT 27:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Umukulu wa fita umwanda umo, pamo ne fita fyali kulinda Yesu, fyalibwene ikinkukuma na fimbipo ifyakitikile fyonse no kupeshiwa mano no kwebati, “Mukine fye ali ni Mwana Lesa!”<verse eid="MAT 27:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />Palipo na banakashi abengi abali akatalamukila abali kukonka Yesu no kumupyungila ukufuma ku Galile. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Pali balya, palipo Maliya Mandalena, Maliya muka Sebede, nyinabo lyakwa Yakobo na Yosefu.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ba mushika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mako15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka23.50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yowane19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Pa kyungulo, kwalishilepo uwafyuma umo ukufuma ku Alimatiya, uweshina lya Yosefu naye ali musambi wakwa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />Ailekulomba umubili wa kwa Yesu kuli Pilato, elo pilato asuminishe ukumupeela. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Elo Yosefu asendele no ku mupomba mu nsalu iyipya. <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />Epakubika na mu nshishi yakwe iyipya, iyo aimbile mukilibwe, akunkulushishepo ikilibwe pa mwenshi wa nshishi, elo afuminepo aya. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />Maliya Mandalena na Maliya munakwe balikele apalungatene ne nshishi.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bakalinda wa nshishi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Ubushiku bwakonkelepo panuma ya bushiku ubwakupekanya bwali li Sabata, banshimapepo bakindami baisa ku kumanya Pilato. <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />Balitampile ukulanda ati, “Kanabesa, tukoibusha ati ulya kabepa wabufi ulo ali talafwa alilandilepo ati, ‘Ndi no ku bushiwa panuma ya nshiku shitatu.’ <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Ekyo ebekesheni bakalinda wa nshishi baikingilile bwino bwino mpaka ubushiku bwa kulenga butatu epali abasambi bakwe baya kwiba umubili, no kweba bantu ati, ‘Alibushiwe ku bakufwa.’ Ubufi bwa pakupelekeshako bukesa kubipishapo pa bwa kuntampilo.”<verse eid="MAT 27:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Pilato alibebekeshe ati, “Mubone ati inshishi yalindwa bwino bwino.”<verse eid="MAT 27:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Ulo bafumine apo baile kubikapo ikikakatikilo pa kilibwe no kubonati abalinshi bakolonda lonse.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s">Ukushikuka kwakwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Mako16.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka24.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yowane20.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Panuma ye Sabata, mu kukya kwa bushiku bwa ntanshi ubwa mulungu, Maliya Mandalena na Maliya munakwe bailekulolesha pa nshishi. <verse eid="MAT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Pekapo kwali kubapo ikinkukuma ikikulu pantu malaika wakwa Shikulu alikile ukufuma mwiulu, ukwisa kunkulushapo ikilibwe no kwikalapo. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Mukuboneka ali kuboneka kubati ni nkuba ne kinso ikya kutuba nge mfula ya kutuba. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Bakalinda baliketwe umwenso, pa kututuma bali nga bakufwa.<verse eid="MAT 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />Malaika epakulanda kubanakashi ati, “Mwiba na mwenso. Ndishibile ati mukofwaya Yesu uwatanikilwe. <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />Talipo pano, alishikukile ku bakufwa nge fyo amyebele. Samubone apo alambalikilwe. <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />Kabuyeni kangu muye kwebako abasambi bakwe ati, Yesu alibukile ku bakufwa kabili akomitangilila ku Galile eko mukoya kumubona. Nomba nebo ndimyebele.”<verse eid="MAT 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Epakufuma ku nshishi kangu kangu, mu mwenso kabili mu nsansa, balibutukile mukwebako abasambi bakwe.<verse eid="MAT 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Pekapo Yesu alibakumenye no kubeba ati, “Umutende.” Elo bamupalamine, balikete kunkasa shakwe no ku mushinshimuna. <verse eid="MAT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Yesu alibebele ati, “Mwiba na mwenso, kabuyeni mwebeko bawesu baye ku Galile eko bakesa kumbona.”<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukushimika kwaba kalinda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Ulo abanakashi balimukuya, bakalinda bamo balibwekelemo ku musumba no kuya kwebako banshimapepo bakindami fyonse ifyakitikile. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />Elo banshimapepo bakindami bakolongene pamo na bakilolo, balipingene no kufumya indalama ishingi no kupeela ifita. <verse eid="MAT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />No kubebati, “Mukalande fye ati, ‘Abasambi bakwe balishile ubushiku no kwiba umubili wakwe ulo twali tulilele mu tulo.’ <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Pakwebati umulashi ngaumfwe fyo, fwebo tukamulabaisha mpaka mukasangwe abakaele, ekyo mwebo mwisakamikwa.”<verse eid="MAT 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Bakalinda pakupoka shilya ndalama, baile ku kita ifyo baebelwe. Ekyo ukufika na kali lelo, ili lyashi lilasabankaniwa pa kati ka Bayuda.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu abonekela ku basambi bakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mako16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka24.36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yowane20.19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Imilimo1.6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />Elo abasambi ikumi limo na umo balifikile ku Galile pa lupili apo Yesu abebele ukuya. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />Pakumubona, bali mushinshimwine, nomba bambi balitwishikile. <verse eid="MAT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Yesu pa ku bapalamina alibebele ati, “Amaka yonse mwiulu na pesonde yalipeelwe kuli nebo. <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Kabuyeni ku bantu bamishobo yonse, muye kupangamo abasambi bangi. No kulekuba batisha mwishina lya Tata, ilya Mwana ne lya Mupashi wa Mushilo. <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />Mukale kubafundisha ukukonka fyonse fyo na myebele. Kabili na lekuba na mwebo mpaka fye napo isonde likapwila.”<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>